  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_11', 'evolink-portrait-11-korean-idol-3x3-grid-portrait', 'Korean Idol 3x3 Grid Portrait', '9:16 vertical, Korean idol portrait photoshoot, 3x3 grid (nine frames), same person in all images, consistent facial features and styling, soft black mist filter effect, lowered contrast, blooming highlights, subtle glow around light sources', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Korean Idol 3x3 Grid Portrait 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 9:16 vertical, Korean idol portrait photoshoot, 3x3 grid (nine frames), same person in all images, consistent facial features and styling, soft black mist filter effect, lowered contrast, blooming highlights, subtle glow around light sources @BubbleBrain EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/BubbleBrain/status/2046268941941850575', '@BubbleBrain', 'published', NULL, 11010, 1160, 585, 2420, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
