  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_15', 'evolink-portrait-15-fujifilm-strawberry-school-portrait', 'Fujifilm Strawberry School Portrait', '9:16 vertical — Japanese Fuji film style portrait, single subject  Fujifilm analog aesthetic (Pro 400H / Superia feel), soft pastel tones, slight green-magenta shift, low contrast, gentle highlight roll-off, fine film grain, subtle halation, slight vignette  bright natural daylight, diffused sunlight through window, soft shadows, airy atmosphere  young Japanese female idol, natural minimal makeup, fresh glowing skin, realistic texture, slight imperfections  outfit: Japanese school uniform (sailor-style or blazer uniform), neatly styled, non-revealing, youthful and clean  hair: natural dark hair, straight or softly flowing, a few loose strands  pose: front-facing or slight angle toward camera, relaxed posture; one hand gently holding a strawberry near lips, mid-action as if about to take a bite; shoulders relaxed, subtle natural body curve  expression: soft playful gaze, light smile or neutral lips, gentle eye contact with camera  setting: minimal indoor near window or simple outdoor corner, clean background, everyday atmosphere  composition: slightly off-center framing, intimate distance, candid feel  mood: fresh, youthful, sweet everyday moment, understated charm  quality: ultra-realistic, analog film look, natural imperfections, soft dreamy finish', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Fujifilm Strawberry School Portrait 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 9:16 vertical — Japanese Fuji film style portrait, single subject  Fujifilm analog aesthetic (Pro 400H / Superia feel), soft pastel tones, slight green-magenta shift, low contrast, gentle highlight roll-off, fine film grain, subtle halation, slight vignette  bright natural daylight, diffused sunlight through window, soft shadows, airy atmosphere  young Japanese female idol, natural minimal makeup, fresh glowing skin, realistic texture, slight imperfections  outfit: Japanese school uniform (sailor-style or blazer uniform), neatly styled, non-revealing, youthful and clean  hair: natural dark hair, straight or softly flowing, a few loose strands  pose: front-facing or slight angle toward camera, relaxed posture; one hand gently holding a strawberry near lips, mid-action as if about to take a bite; shoulders relaxed, subtle natural body curve  expression: soft playful gaze, light smile or neutral lips, gentle eye contact with camera  setting: minimal indoor near window or simple outdoor corner, clean background, everyday atmosphere  composition: slightly off-center framing, intimate distance, candid feel  mood: fresh, youthful, sweet everyday moment, understated charm  quality: ultra-realistic, analog film look, natural imperfections, soft dreamy finish @BubbleBrain EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_fashion tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/BubbleBrain/status/2046483268019884384', '@BubbleBrain', 'published', NULL, 10938, 1152, 581, 2404, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
