aling elements  hair: long dark hair, slightly messy, natural volume, softly flowing  pose: relaxed standing or slight lean, body subtly angled, one leg slightly forward, shoulders relaxed; one hand lightly touching collar or resting near neckline, the other relaxed; gentle body curve without exaggeration  expression: soft cute smile, slightly playful eyes, direct or slightly off-camera gaze  camera: close to mid-body framing, eye-level, intimate distance, slight handheld feel  lighting: diffused natural daylight, soft shadows, gentle light wrapping around face and body  mood: cute yet subtly sensual, intimate, everyday softness, quiet romantic atmosphere  quality: ultra-realistic, fine film grain, slight softness at edges, natural imperfections, dreamy understated tone @BubbleBrain EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_ui tag_game tag_fashion tag_typography', 'https://x.com/BubbleBrain/status/2046518189509734903', '@BubbleBrain', 'published', NULL, 10920, 1150, 580, 2400, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
