  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_24', 'evolink-portrait-24-a-hyper-realistic-ui-ux-mockup-displayed-on-a-slim-modern-laptop-placed-', 'A hyper-realistic UI/UX mockup displayed on a slim modern laptop placed on a ...', 'A hyper-realistic UI/UX mockup displayed on a slim modern laptop placed on a minimal wooden desk with soft natural daylight. The screen shows a clean SaaS dashboard with elegant typography, glassmorphism cards, smooth gradients, subtle drop shadows, and neatly spaced components. Visible charts, analytics panels, sidebar navigation, and micro-interactions. Realistic macOS-style window frame, soft reflections on the screen, shallow depth of field, cozy workspace atmosphere, shot in photorealistic product photography style, ultra-detailed.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'A hyper-realistic UI/UX mockup displayed on a slim modern laptop placed on a ... 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 A hyper-realistic UI/UX mockup displayed on a slim modern laptop placed on a minimal wooden desk with soft natural daylight. The screen shows a clean SaaS dashboard with elegant typography, glassmorphism cards, smooth gradients, subtle drop shadows, and neatly spaced components. Visible charts, analytics panels, sidebar navigation, and micro-interactions. Realistic macOS-style window frame, soft reflections on the screen, shallow depth of field, cozy workspace atmosphere, shot in photorealistic product photography style, ultra-detailed. @ZaraIrahh EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_ui tag_mockup tag_scifi tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/ZaraIrahh/status/2047179669011616172', '@ZaraIrahh', 'published', NULL, 10776, 1134, 572, 2368, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
