VALUES
  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_28', 'evolink-portrait-28-old-delhi-sweet-shop-storefront-documentary-photo', 'Old Delhi Sweet Shop Storefront Documentary Photo', 'Create a photorealistic travel-documentary image of a small sweet-shop storefront in Old Delhi at midday. A painted shop signboard above the door reads "मिठाई की दुकान" in large bold yellow hand-painted Devanagari on a deep red background, with "SWEET SHOP" in smaller roman letters beneath. Realistic hand-painted texture, slight wear, natural shadow. Authentic script proportion. Spelling and characters exact. No extra signage in frame, no watermark.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Old Delhi Sweet Shop Storefront Documentary Photo 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 Create a photorealistic travel-documentary image of a small sweet-shop storefront in Old Delhi at midday. A painted shop signboard above the door reads "मिठाई की दुकान" in large bold yellow hand-painted Devanagari on a deep red background, with "SWEET SHOP" in smaller roman letters beneath. Realistic hand-painted texture, slight wear, natural shadow. Authentic script proportion. Spelling and characters exact. No extra signage in frame, no watermark. @commanderdgr8 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_typography', 'https://x.com/commanderdgr8/status/2047889839123521635', '@commanderdgr8', 'published', NULL, 10704, 1126, 568, 2352, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
