  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_29', 'evolink-portrait-29-cyberpunk-sci-fi-side-profile-portrait', 'Cyberpunk Sci-Fi Side Profile Portrait', 'A cinematic side-profile portrait of a rugged man with a tied-back bun and full beard, wearing round dark sunglasses and a textured leather jacket. His skin is detailed and slightly weathered. The background is a futuristic sci-fi interface filled with glowing orange and red data streams, star maps, celestial navigation diagrams, grids, and holographic UI elements. Fiery particle effects and ember-like energy swirl around him, creating a cosmic, high-tech atmosphere. Dark color palette with strong contrast, dramatic lighting, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, 8K, cyberpunk aesthetic, cinematic composition, depth of field.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Cyberpunk Sci-Fi Side Profile Portrait 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 A cinematic side-profile portrait of a rugged man with a tied-back bun and full beard, wearing round dark sunglasses and a textured leather jacket. His skin is detailed and slightly weathered. The background is a futuristic sci-fi interface filled with glowing orange and red data streams, star maps, celestial navigation diagrams, grids, and holographic UI elements. Fiery particle effects and ember-like energy swirl around him, creating a cosmic, high-tech atmosphere. Dark color palette with strong contrast, dramatic lighting, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, 8K, cyberpunk aesthetic, cinematic composition, depth of field. @iamsofiaijaz EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_ui tag_scifi tag_infographic tag_typography', 'https://x.com/iamsofiaijaz/status/2047882171336253928', '@iamsofiaijaz', 'published', NULL, 10686, 1124, 567, 2348, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
