VALUES
  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_83', 'evolink-portrait-83-damaged-vintage-mother-and-child-photo', 'Damaged Vintage Mother and Child Photo', 'A heavily damaged old family snapshot in faded black and white with a slight sepia cast, shown as a worn physical photograph scanned straight-on. The image depicts a seated woman holding a small child on her lap indoors, both centered in a simple portrait composition. The woman has short dark wavy hair and wears a dark sleeveless dress or pinafore layered over a lighter short-sleeved blouse. The child appears to be a toddler with very short light hair, wearing a light-colored outfit, facing the camera while sitting against the woman’s chest and arm. Behind them is a patterned curtain with small floral or leaf motifs, and above it a dark window area with a pale vertical window frame is visible near the top center. The print is severely deteriorated: extensive scratches, creases, emulsion damage, stains, blotches, and peeling cover the entire surface, with especially heavy white abrasion and loss of detail across the bottom third and scattered cracking throughout. Keep the overall look authentic to a mid-20th-century vernacular photo, low contrast, soft focus, and visibly aged paper texture. Add a rectangular blurred censor block over the woman’s face only, while the child’s face remains visible but faded. No text, no border, just the distressed archival photograph filling the frame.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Damaged Vintage Mother and Child Photo 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 A heavily damaged old family snapshot in faded black and white with a slight sepia cast, shown as a worn physical photograph scanned straight-on. The image depicts a seated woman holding a small child on her lap indoors, both centered in a simple portrait composition. The woman has short dark wavy hair and wears a dark sleeveless dress or pinafore layered over a lighter short-sleeved blouse. The child appears to be a toddler with very short light hair, wearing a light-colored outfit, facing the camera while sitting against the woman’s chest and arm. Behind them is a patterned curtain with small floral or leaf motifs, and above it a dark window area with a pale vertical window frame is visible near the top center. The print is severely deteriorated: extensive scratches, creases, emulsion damage, stains, blotches, and peeling cover the entire surface, with especially heavy white abrasion and loss of detail across the bottom third and scattered cracking throughout. Keep the overall look authentic to a mid-20th-century vernacular photo, low contrast, soft focus, and visibly aged paper texture. Add a rectangular blurred censor block over the woman’s face only, while the child’s face remains visible but faded. No text, no border, just the distressed archival photograph filling the frame. @gdb EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_poster tag_ui tag_fashion tag_typography', 'https://x.com/gdb/status/2048184797374325031', '@gdb', 'published', NULL, 10614, 1116, 563, 2332, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
