  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_87', 'evolink-portrait-87-3d-cartoon-character-render', '3D Cartoon Character Render', 'High-quality 3D CGI render of {argument name="character" default="[character]"} in a charming cartoon style, portrait composition showing head and shoulders. Highly stylized caricature with exaggerated, expressive features that are both playful and humorous. Smooth, polished rendering with clean materials and soft ambient lighting creating gentle shadows. Dynamic camera angle with stylish perspective. Minimalist bright {argument name="background color" default="[color]"} background that makes the character pop and stand out. Professional Pixar-like quality with glossy finish and cheerful mood.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', '3D Cartoon Character Render 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 High-quality 3D CGI render of {argument name="character" default="[character]"} in a charming cartoon style, portrait composition showing head and shoulders. Highly stylized caricature with exaggerated, expressive features that are both playful and humorous. Smooth, polished rendering with clean materials and soft ambient lighting creating gentle shadows. Dynamic camera angle with stylish perspective. Minimalist bright {argument name="background color" default="[color]"} background that makes the character pop and stand out. Professional Pixar-like quality with glossy finish and cheerful mood. @Inshrah_ali_ EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_3d', 'https://x.com/Inshrah_ali_/status/2048121503367995753', '@Inshrah_ali_', 'published', NULL, 10542, 1108, 559, 2316, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
