  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_88', 'evolink-portrait-88-young-woman-in-sequin-dress-on-stairs', 'Young Woman in Sequin Dress on Stairs', 'Vertical 2:3 format. {argument name="subject" default="Young woman"} hair in messy updo sits on modern wooden staircase. wears {argument name="dress" default="shimmering Silver halter dress sequin dress"}. matching with silver high-heeled sandals. legs crossed. Silver heart earrings. One fuchsia bracelet on each ankle. Sultry expression, with slightly parted lips. Blurred background vertical wooden slats and black metal railings. Don''t change face', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Young Woman in Sequin Dress on Stairs 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 Vertical 2:3 format. {argument name="subject" default="Young woman"} hair in messy updo sits on modern wooden staircase. wears {argument name="dress" default="shimmering Silver halter dress sequin dress"}. matching with silver high-heeled sandals. legs crossed. Silver heart earrings. One fuchsia bracelet on each ankle. Sultry expression, with slightly parted lips. Blurred background vertical wooden slats and black metal railings. Don''t change face @XSydneyFan EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_ui', 'https://x.com/XSydneyFan/status/2048114180906217566', '@XSydneyFan', 'published', NULL, 10524, 1106, 558, 2312, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
