ait photography quality, details are clear but restrained, no grain, no noise, real physical lighting, 8K, commercial-grade quality. Aspect ratio: 9:16 @liyue_ai EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_ui tag_fashion tag_typography tag_gufeng', 'https://x.com/liyue_ai/status/2048046253842559183', '@liyue_ai', 'published', NULL, 10470, 1100, 555, 2300, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
