VALUES
  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_97', 'evolink-portrait-97-dark-gatorade-style-portrait', 'Dark Gatorade-Style Portrait', 'A dramatic, high-contrast studio portrait of a {argument name="subject gender" default="male"} athlete or model in the visual style of a premium sports drink advertisement, centered and facing straight toward the camera in a tight head-and-shoulders crop. The subject has {argument name="hair style" default="short dark hair brushed back"}, visible ears on both sides, and a rugged lower face with a short beard or stubble. Dress him in a dark zip-up athletic jacket with the zipper centered and visible near the collar. Use an almost entirely black background and extremely low-key lighting, with subtle rim light and soft highlights catching the hair, ears, jawline, shoulders, and jacket texture while most facial features remain swallowed by shadow for a mysterious, intense mood. The image should feel monochrome or nearly monochrome, with deep blacks, muted gray highlights, cinematic contrast, gritty texture, and a sleek commercial sports-brand aesthetic reminiscent of a {argument name="brand style" default="Gatorade"} campaign. Vertical composition, minimalist framing, no text, no logo, no props, no visible environment.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Dark Gatorade-Style Portrait 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 A dramatic, high-contrast studio portrait of a {argument name="subject gender" default="male"} athlete or model in the visual style of a premium sports drink advertisement, centered and facing straight toward the camera in a tight head-and-shoulders crop. The subject has {argument name="hair style" default="short dark hair brushed back"}, visible ears on both sides, and a rugged lower face with a short beard or stubble. Dress him in a dark zip-up athletic jacket with the zipper centered and visible near the collar. Use an almost entirely black background and extremely low-key lighting, with subtle rim light and soft highlights catching the hair, ears, jawline, shoulders, and jacket texture while most facial features remain swallowed by shadow for a mysterious, intense mood. The image should feel monochrome or nearly monochrome, with deep blacks, muted gray highlights, cinematic contrast, gritty texture, and a sleek commercial sports-brand aesthetic reminiscent of a {argument name="brand style" default="Gatorade"} campaign. Vertical composition, minimalist framing, no text, no logo, no props, no visible environment. @jeremydevz EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_food tag_logo tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/jeremydevz/status/2048026214812561683', '@jeremydevz', 'published', NULL, 10362, 1088, 549, 2276, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
