  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_104', 'evolink-portrait-104-ccd-flash-beauty-portrait-template', 'CCD flash beauty portrait template', 'A hyper-photorealistic shot of the same subject in the attached image, ultra-detailed facial features, visible pores, natural skin texture, rosy complexion and dewy skin, Douyin/Korean glass-skin makeup, glossy lips, aegyosal, baby pink blush, high identity consistency, realistic human anatomy. Use an old CCD digital camera aesthetic with direct flash, visible grain, slight overexposure, cool-neutral white balance, slight motion blur, and candid composition. Hair in a loose romantic updo; outfit in delicate off-shoulder silk with embroidered floral fabric; background of pastel floral bedding; horizontal close-up; shallow depth of field. Negative prompt: over-smoothed skin, plastic texture, unrealistic proportions, studio lighting, overly sharp HDR, stiff pose, artificial symmetry, over-retouched face.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'CCD flash beauty portrait template 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 A hyper-photorealistic shot of the same subject in the attached image, ultra-detailed facial features, visible pores, natural skin texture, rosy complexion and dewy skin, Douyin/Korean glass-skin makeup, glossy lips, aegyosal, baby pink blush, high identity consistency, realistic human anatomy. Use an old CCD digital camera aesthetic with direct flash, visible grain, slight overexposure, cool-neutral white balance, slight motion blur, and candid composition. Hair in a loose romantic updo; outfit in delicate off-shoulder silk with embroidered floral fabric; background of pastel floral bedding; horizontal close-up; shallow depth of field. Negative prompt: over-smoothed skin, plastic texture, unrealistic proportions, studio lighting, overly sharp HDR, stiff pose, artificial symmetry, over-retouched face. @AIwithAliya EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_fashion tag_typography tag_cinematic tag_gufeng', 'https://x.com/AIwithAliya/status/2049452006608392350', '@AIwithAliya', 'published', NULL, 10236, 1074, 542, 2248, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
