  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_109', 'evolink-portrait-109-2x2-editorial-portrait-grid', '2x2 Editorial Portrait Grid', 'GPT IMAGE 2 ON CHATGPT Prompt: Editorial portrait photography arranged in a 2x2 grid layout featuring the same man with round tortoiseshell glasses, natural look, light beard, soft neutral background. Top-left: front-facing portrait with direct eye contact, calm expression. Top-right: extreme macro close-up of eye behind glasses, ultra-detailed iris and skin texture. Bottom-left: slightly lower angle portrait, subtle expression, soft shadows. Bottom-right: side profile portrait, natural pose, looking away. Soft diffused natural lighting, warm neutral tones, shallow depth of field, ultra-realistic skin texture with visible pores and freckles, minimal retouching, 85mm lens, high-end editorial photography style, clean composition, 4K', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', '2x2 Editorial Portrait Grid 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 GPT IMAGE 2 ON CHATGPT Prompt: Editorial portrait photography arranged in a 2x2 grid layout featuring the same man with round tortoiseshell glasses, natural look, light beard, soft neutral background. Top-left: front-facing portrait with direct eye contact, calm expression. Top-right: extreme macro close-up of eye behind glasses, ultra-detailed iris and skin texture. Bottom-left: slightly lower angle portrait, subtle expression, soft shadows. Bottom-right: side profile portrait, natural pose, looking away. Soft diffused natural lighting, warm neutral tones, shallow depth of field, ultra-realistic skin texture with visible pores and freckles, minimal retouching, 85mm lens, high-end editorial photography style, clean composition, 4K @Taaruk_ EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_infographic tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/Taaruk_/status/2050429694890389779', '@Taaruk_', 'published', NULL, 10146, 1064, 537, 2228, cast(unixepoch('subs