  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_115', 'evolink-portrait-115-basketball-boy-motion-sequence', 'Basketball Boy Motion Sequence', 'A photorealistic video sequence captures a young boy with messy orange hair and thick-framed glasses, as seen in image_0.png, image_1.png, and other source frames. He is dressed in a black basketball jersey and matching shorts with purple and blue trim, featuring the text "WIZZGEN 23" on the front and "CHICAGO 23" on the back (image_4.png). The setting is an outdoor asphalt city basketball court with green trees and a visible basketball hoop. The action begins with the boy in a low stance, dribbling the ball between his legs (image_0.png through image_3.png), then transitions to him standing taller and performing crossovers (image_5.png through image_7.png), followed by him successfully spinning the ball on his finger (image_8.png), and finally posing with a peace sign while holding the ball (image_9.png). The lighting is soft daylight under an overcast sky.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Basketball Boy Motion Sequence 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 A photorealistic video sequence captures a young boy with messy orange hair and thick-framed glasses, as seen in image_0.png, image_1.png, and other source frames. He is dressed in a black basketball jersey and matching shorts with purple and blue trim, featuring the text "WIZZGEN 23" on the front and "CHICAGO 23" on the back (image_4.png). The setting is an outdoor asphalt city basketball court with green trees and a visible basketball hoop. The action begins with the boy in a low stance, dribbling the ball between his legs (image_0.png through image_3.png), then transitions to him standing taller and performing crossovers (image_5.png through image_7.png), followed by him successfully spinning the ball on his finger (image_8.png), and finally posing with a peace sign while holding the ball (image_9.png). The lighting is soft daylight under an overcast sky. @Taaruk_ EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_typography', 'https://x.com/Taaruk_/status/2049702491768684839', '@Taaruk_', 'published', NULL, 10038, 1052, 531, 2204, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
