  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_117', 'evolink-portrait-117-chibi-3d-mini-me-photo-effect', 'Chibi 3D Mini Me Photo Effect', 'Mini "chibi 3D" versions of the same person appear around the original photo — sitting, climbing, playing, interacting with objects — with realistic shadows and depth. Keep base image unchanged. Add soft handwritten text: "Little versions of me… living my quiet moments." Include tiny props text like "You got this ♡". Cinematic, cozy, viral aesthetic.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Chibi 3D Mini Me Photo Effect 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 Mini "chibi 3D" versions of the same person appear around the original photo — sitting, climbing, playing, interacting with objects — with realistic shadows and depth. Keep base image unchanged. Add soft handwritten text: "Little versions of me… living my quiet moments." Include tiny props text like "You got this ♡". Cinematic, cozy, viral aesthetic. @miratechtool EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_ui tag_3d tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/miratechtool/status/2051691169592033488', '@miratechtool', 'published', NULL, 10002, 1048, 529, 2196, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
