  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_135', 'evolink-portrait-135-demon-empress-lilitha-fantasy-poster', 'Demon Empress Lilitha Fantasy Poster', 'Epic dark-fantasy anime poster illustration featuring a powerful demon empress named “Lilitha”, designed in an ultra-detailed watercolor and ink-splatter art style. Massive cinematic vertical composition with a graceful side-profile portrait of a mesmerizing woman with porcelain skin, long flowing moonlit lavender hair, glowing ruby eyes, and a subtle dangerous smile. Elegant obsidian-and-crimson horns curve from her head while gigantic shadowy bat wings sweep across the frame like a living cloak.
