  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_155', 'evolink-portrait-155-graffiti-restroom-glam-portrait', 'Graffiti Restroom Glam Portrait', 'A highly detailed cinematic photograph of a beautiful young woman with long wavy fiery blonde hair and fair skin with light freckles, standing in a uncleaned neglected public restroom with peeling light green tiles covered in colorful graffiti and stickers. She is wearing a sleek white glitter strapless mini dress and applying vibrant red lipstick with a lipstick tube in her right hand while her left hand rests on the edge of a sink. Her head is slightly turned to the side with a confident gaze.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Graffiti Restroom Glam Portrait 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 A highly detailed cinematic photograph of a beautiful young woman with long wavy fiery blonde hair and fair skin with light freckles, standing in a uncleaned neglected public restroom with peeling light green tiles covered in colorful graffiti and stickers. She is wearing a sleek white glitter strapless mini dress and applying vibrant red lipstick with a lipstick tube in her right hand while her left hand rests on the edge of a sink. Her head is slightly turned to the side with a confident gaze. @KeorUnreal EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_poster tag_ui tag_sticker tag_architecture', 'https://x.com/KeorUnreal/status/2052785320970572141', '@KeorUnreal', 'published', NULL, 9318, 972, 491, 2044, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
