  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_157', 'evolink-portrait-157-selfie-look-up-hand-pointing-portrait', 'Selfie Look-Up Hand Pointing Portrait', 'A raw, highly authentic, and heavily unpolished amateur smartphone selfie, explicitly captured with an iPhone front-facing camera. The overall image features prominent camera shake and strong motion blur, giving it a frantic, imperfect, and slightly out-of-focus aesthetic. In the extreme foreground, a person looks directly into the lens with a slight, natural smile, hastily pointing one finger up towards the sky. Looming above in the dramatic, overcast sky is a massive, futuristic metallic UFO f', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Selfie Look-Up Hand Pointing Portrait 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 A raw, highly authentic, and heavily unpolished amateur smartphone selfie, explicitly captured with an iPhone front-facing camera. The overall image features prominent camera shake and strong motion blur, giving it a frantic, imperfect, and slightly out-of-focus aesthetic. In the extreme foreground, a person looks directly into the lens with a slight, natural smile, hastily pointing one finger up towards the sky. Looming above in the dramatic, overcast sky is a massive, futuristic metallic UFO f @ozansihay EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_mockup tag_scifi tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/ozansihay/status/2052811738345615370', '@ozansihay', 'published', NULL, 9282, 968, 489, 2036, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
