VALUES
  ('prompt_evolink_portrait_167', 'evolink-portrait-167-korean-convenience-store-portrait', 'Korean Convenience Store Portrait', 'Ultra-realistic cozy Korean convenience store portrait of the same woman standing in front of glowing refrigerator aisles at night wearing a fluffy pastel pink hoodie. She holds strawberry milk and a tiny cake while looking shyly toward the camera. Soft blushy makeup, glossy eyes, natural skin texture, warm fluorescent lighting mixed with iPhone flash. Tiny reflections on the drink bottles, cute romantic atmosphere, soft pink and cream tones, dreamy slice-of-life anime realism.', '人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Korean Convenience Store Portrait 人像摄影、头像、写真和角色肖像。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 人像摄影 Ultra-realistic cozy Korean convenience store portrait of the same woman standing in front of glowing refrigerator aisles at night wearing a fluffy pastel pink hoodie. She holds strawberry milk and a tiny cake while looking shyly toward the camera. Soft blushy makeup, glossy eyes, natural skin texture, warm fluorescent lighting mixed with iPhone flash. Tiny reflections on the drink bottles, cute romantic atmosphere, soft pink and cream tones, dreamy slice-of-life anime realism. @AIWithRay EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_portrait tag_photography tag_food tag_mockup tag_anime tag_typography', 'https://x.com/AIWithRay/status/2053407281719415273', '@AIWithRay', 'published', NULL, 9102, 948, 479, 1996, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
