  ('prompt_evolink_poster_4', 'evolink-poster-4-chinese-minimalist-s-shaped-poster', 'Chinese Minimalist S-Shaped Poster', '极简新中式美学风格，画面以淡雅的灰白色为底，呈现出一种纸艺剪影般的立体感。
