  ('prompt_evolink_poster_58', 'evolink-poster-58-a-full-body-outdoor-shot-captures-a-young-caucasian-woman-possibly-in-he', 'A full-body outdoor shot captures a young Caucasian woman, possibly in her la...', 'A full-body outdoor shot captures a young Caucasian woman, possibly in her late 20s, striding through a city crosswalk. She wears an oversized, matte chocolate-brown leather jacket paired with a free-flowing black skirt and sleek knee-high black boots, conveying a sense of high fashion street style. Her long, dark brown hair is wind-swept, complementing her poised and confident expression as she glances sideways. Behind her, a blurred urban backdrop features a yellow taxi and pedestrians, with buildings displaying varied architectural details in neutral tones. The scene utilizes soft ambient daylight filtering through light cloud cover, producing a muted, overcast lighting effect. The warm, earthy color palette consists of brown, black, and touches of beige. The image, likely from a high-resolution digital camera, presents a wide-angle view that maintains focus throughout, emphasizing a dynamic and fashionable feel.', '海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'A full-body outdoor shot captures a young Caucasian woman, possibly in her la... 海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 海报插画 A full-body outdoor shot captures a young Caucasian woman, possibly in her late 20s, striding through a city crosswalk. She wears an oversized, matte chocolate-brown leather jacket paired with a free-flowing black skirt and sleek knee-high black boots, conveying a sense of high fashion street style. Her long, dark brown hair is wind-swept, complementing her poised and confident expression as she glances sideways. Behind her, a blurred urban backdrop features a yellow taxi and pedestrians, with buildings displaying varied architectural details in neutral tones. The scene utilizes soft ambient daylight filtering through light cloud cover, producing a muted, overcast lighting effect. The warm, earthy color palette consists of brown, black, and touches of beige. The image, likely from a high-resolution digital camera, presents a wide-angle view that maintains focus throughout, emphasizing a dynamic and fashionable feel. @AIwithSarah_ EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_food tag_ui tag_fashion', 'https://x.com/AIwithSarah_/status/2047234995627172229', '@AIwithSarah_', 'published', NULL, 8400, 870, 440, 1840, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
