  ('prompt_evolink_poster_138', 'evolink-poster-138-surreal-baroque-painting-reality-fracture', 'Surreal Baroque Painting Reality Fracture', 'A {argument name="painting style" default="baroque oil painting"} comes to life — its painted figures climbing out of the gilded frame into a {argument name="setting" default="modern white gallery"}, half their bodies still in flat 2D paint, half fully volumetric 3D humans, brushstrokes visible on their skin, the painting''s background leaking watercolor clouds into the gallery ceiling, museum visitors frozen in shock, hyper-detailed, {argument name="artist influence" default="René Magritte meets Pixar"}, reality fracturing at every boundary', '海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Surreal Baroque Painting Reality Fracture 海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 海报插画 A {argument name="painting style" default="baroque oil painting"} comes to life — its painted figures climbing out of the gilded frame into a {argument name="setting" default="modern white gallery"}, half their bodies still in flat 2D paint, half fully volumetric 3D humans, brushstrokes visible on their skin, the painting''s background leaking watercolor clouds into the gallery ceiling, museum visitors frozen in shock, hyper-detailed, {argument name="artist influence" default="René Magritte meets Pixar"}, reality fracturing at every boundary @JohnnyWang8802 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_3d tag_architecture', 'https://x.com/JohnnyWang8802/status/2048129335853559824', '@JohnnyWang8802', 'published', NULL, 7608, 782, 396, 1664, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
