  ('prompt_evolink_poster_170', 'evolink-poster-170-iced-coffee-product-infographic', 'Iced Coffee Product Infographic', 'A high-end café-style product photograph of a transparent glass filled with iced coffee, centered against a soft beige and cream seamless studio background. The drink shows a rich dark coffee base blending with creamy milk swirls, creating a smooth gradient effect. Several clear ice cubes are visible with realistic transparency and light refraction. The glass has subtle condensation droplets, adding freshness. Soft natural studio lighting creates delicate highlights and a clean shadow beneath the glass. Ultra-sharp focus, premium beverage advertisement style, DSLR macro photography, hyper realistic, 8K.
