temporary magazine cover design, minimalist layout, subtle futuristic graphic microtext, highly polished commercial fashion retouching, sharp focus, cinematic soft contrast, photorealistic, high detail, 8k @gold_force_guri EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_portrait tag_3d tag_scifi', 'https://x.com/gold_force_guri/status/2050428455360348191', '@gold_force_guri', 'published', NULL, 7176, 734, 372, 1568, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
