  ('prompt_evolink_poster_194', 'evolink-poster-194-product-photography-juice-ad', 'Product Photography Juice Ad', 'A highly realistic low-angle shot of a confident young woman with long, vibrant red hair, holding a watermelon juice can close to the camera in a dramatic perspective. The can appears large in the foreground due to forced perspective, with sharp focus on the product. The woman has fair skin, natural makeup, and a subtle confident expression, looking slightly down toward the camera.
