  ('prompt_evolink_poster_197', 'evolink-poster-197-claymation-cozy-scene-recreation', 'Claymation Cozy Scene Recreation', 'Recreate the scene as a cozy claymation-style world made from soft modeling clay. Every object should have handmade textures, rounded shapes, fingerprints, and soft lighting like a stop-motion movie. Use warm pastel colors and a cute cinematic atmosphere.', '海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Claymation Cozy Scene Recreation 海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 海报插画 Recreate the scene as a cozy claymation-style world made from soft modeling clay. Every object should have handmade textures, rounded shapes, fingerprints, and soft lighting like a stop-motion movie. Use warm pastel colors and a cute cinematic atmosphere. @miratechtool EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_portrait tag_3d tag_typography', 'https://x.com/miratechtool/status/2052033236964950111', '@miratechtool', 'published', NULL, 6906, 704, 357, 1508, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
