  ('prompt_evolink_poster_198', 'evolink-poster-198-anime-warrior-shonen-power-up', 'Anime Warrior Shonen Power-Up', 'Ultra-detailed anime warrior illustration inspired by legendary shonen power-up scenes, full-body low-angle composition, floating god-like character with torn battle clothes, muscular anatomy, intense glowing aura energy exploding around the body, celestial magic circle halo behind the character, cosmic symbols and sacred geometry, crackling lightning, floating debris and rocks, galaxy particles, divine transformation moment, dramatic cinematic lighting, hyper detailed ink lines, painterly anime shading, dynamic energy splashes, glowing embers and sparks, dark cosmic background mixed with radiant aura colors, ultra sharp focus, highly detailed textures, epic manga poster aesthetic, vertical composition, masterpiece quality, 8k.', '海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Anime Warrior Shonen Power-Up 海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 海报插画 Ultra-detailed anime warrior illustration inspired by legendary shonen power-up scenes, full-body low-angle composition, floating god-like character with torn battle clothes, muscular anatomy, intense glowing aura energy exploding around the body, celestial magic circle halo behind the character, cosmic symbols and sacred geometry, crackling lightning, floating debris and rocks, galaxy particles, divine transformation moment, dramatic cinematic lighting, hyper detailed ink lines, painterly anime shading, dynamic energy splashes, glowing embers and sparks, dark cosmic background mixed with radiant aura colors, ultra sharp focus, highly detailed textures, epic manga poster aesthetic, vertical composition, masterpiece quality, 8k. @Taaruk_ EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_logo tag_anime tag_typography', 'https://x.com/Taaruk_/status/2052061103426040157', '@Taaruk_', 'published', NULL, 6888, 702, 356, 1504, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
