  ('prompt_evolink_poster_201', 'evolink-poster-201-hamburg-travel-itinerary-visual', 'Hamburg Travel Itinerary Visual', 'Create a beautiful 3-day travel itinerary visual for a first-time trip to Hamburg. You decide the best schedule, neighborhoods, activities, and food stops. Include: Day 1, Day 2, Day 3 Morning, afternoon, evening A simple map-inspired layout Practical travel tips A short “best for” label for each day Requirements: Make the itinerary realistic and easy to follow. Do not overload the design with too much text. Style: Premium travel guide layout, soft colors, small illustrations, clean typography, editorial magazine feel.', '海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Hamburg Travel Itinerary Visual 海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 海报插画 Create a beautiful 3-day travel itinerary visual for a first-time trip to Hamburg. You decide the best schedule, neighborhoods, activities, and food stops. Include: Day 1, Day 2, Day 3 Morning, afternoon, evening A simple map-inspired layout Practical travel tips A short “best for” label for each day Requirements: Make the itinerary realistic and easy to follow. Do not overload the design with too much text. Style: Premium travel guide layout, soft colors, small illustrations, clean typography, editorial magazine feel. @tisch_eins EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_food tag_ui tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/tisch_eins/status/2052026781566132280', '@tisch_eins', 'published', NULL, 6834, 696, 353, 1492, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
