  ('prompt_evolink_poster_210', 'evolink-poster-210-urban-fashion-editorial-collage-poster', 'Urban Fashion Editorial Collage Poster', 'Create a high-resolution 8K portrait poster in an Urban Fashion Editorial Collage style, blending contemporary street-fashion aesthetics with premium editorial magazine design. The overall composition should feel bold, stylish, modern, and visually layered, combining elements of luxury fashion campaigns, urban culture, and artistic collage experimentation. Incorporate dynamic poster ornaments and decorative elements that strongly reflect the Urban Fashion Editorial Collage aesthetic, such as rip', '海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Urban Fashion Editorial Collage Poster 海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 海报插画 Create a high-resolution 8K portrait poster in an Urban Fashion Editorial Collage style, blending contemporary street-fashion aesthetics with premium editorial magazine design. The overall composition should feel bold, stylish, modern, and visually layered, combining elements of luxury fashion campaigns, urban culture, and artistic collage experimentation. Incorporate dynamic poster ornaments and decorative elements that strongly reflect the Urban Fashion Editorial Collage aesthetic, such as rip @ChillaiKalan__ EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_portrait tag_fashion', 'https://x.com/ChillaiKalan__/status/2052597387169091660', '@ChillaiKalan__', 'published', NULL, 6672, 678, 344, 1456, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
