  ('prompt_evolink_poster_211', 'evolink-poster-211-wildlife-photographer-16-panel-storyboard', 'Wildlife Photographer 16-Panel Storyboard', 'Create a cinematic 16-panel storyboard infographic showing the adventure of a young female wildlife photographer traveling into a deep forest to photograph a majestic lion. Use a realistic movie-storyboard style with warm natural colors, dramatic sunlight, jungle atmosphere, cinematic camera angles, and professional wildlife documentary aesthetics. The same realistic young woman should appear consistently in every panel wearing outdoor explorer clothing, hiking boots, backpack, and carrying a pr', '海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Wildlife Photographer 16-Panel Storyboard 海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 海报插画 Create a cinematic 16-panel storyboard infographic showing the adventure of a young female wildlife photographer traveling into a deep forest to photograph a majestic lion. Use a realistic movie-storyboard style with warm natural colors, dramatic sunlight, jungle atmosphere, cinematic camera angles, and professional wildlife documentary aesthetics. The same realistic young woman should appear consistently in every panel wearing outdoor explorer clothing, hiking boots, backpack, and carrying a pr @saniaspeaks_ EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_ui tag_fashion tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/saniaspeaks_/status/2052727888894734731', '@saniaspeaks_', 'published', NULL, 6654, 676, 343, 1452, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
