  ('prompt_evolink_poster_238', 'evolink-poster-238-portrait-collage-fashion-poster', 'Portrait Collage Fashion Poster', 'High-end portrait collage poster in vertical format. The background contains four layered rounded strips displaying black-and-white film-like images of a curly-haired male model wearing dark sunglasses in varied poses. In front, a vivid color cutout of the same character is placed to the left, dressed in an unbuttoned soft pink shirt, styled like a luxury fashion campaign with dramatic lighting and depth.', '海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Portrait Collage Fashion Poster 海报、插画、视觉主 KV 和排版设计。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 海报插画 High-end portrait collage poster in vertical format. The background contains four layered rounded strips displaying black-and-white film-like images of a curly-haired male model wearing dark sunglasses in varied poses. In front, a vivid color cutout of the same character is placed to the left, dressed in an unbuttoned soft pink shirt, styled like a luxury fashion campaign with dramatic lighting and depth. @Mind_Boticni EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_poster tag_design tag_illustration tag_portrait tag_fashion tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/Mind_Boticni/status/2053489348470051163', '@Mind_Boticni', 'published', NULL, 6168, 622, 316, 1344, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
