  ('prompt_evolink_ui_3', 'evolink-ui-3-handwritten-notebook-photo', 'Handwritten Notebook Photo', 'Amateur photo of an open notebook lying flat, filled with handwritten notes in black ballpoint pen. The handwriting is casual and slightly messy, like personnal notes, natural imperfections, crossed out words, underlined headings. Shot from slightly above, natural daylight from a window, no flash. Casual desk setting, shot on iPhone', 'UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Handwritten Notebook Photo UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 UI 与社媒 Amateur photo of an open notebook lying flat, filled with handwritten notes in black ballpoint pen. The handwriting is casual and slightly messy, like personnal notes, natural imperfections, crossed out words, underlined headings. Shot from slightly above, natural daylight from a window, no flash. Casual desk setting, shot on iPhone @patrickassale EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_ui tag_design tag_mockup tag_cinematic tag_illustration', 'https://x.com/patrickassale/status/2044569086013718958', '@patrickassale', 'published', NULL, 5808, 582, 296, 1264, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
