VALUES
  ('prompt_evolink_ui_104', 'evolink-ui-104-golden-cocktail-in-greenhouse-bar', 'Golden Cocktail in Greenhouse Bar', 'A cinematic vertical photo of a hand holding up a large balloon wine glass filled with a sparkling golden-yellow citrus cocktail in a lush indoor greenhouse bar. The drink is backlit by warm late-afternoon sunlight, making it glow translucent amber. Inside the glass there is 1 visible citrus wedge, and at the rim there is 1 fresh mint garnish cluster. The hand enters from the lower left, delicately gripping the stem, wearing 1 chunky translucent amber bracelet. The setting is dense with tropical greenery, hanging ferns, and vine-covered walls, with a bright greenhouse roof structure visible overhead and 2 warm exposed hanging bulbs softly glowing in the background. Use shallow depth of field with creamy bokeh, strong sun rays filtering through leaves, soft haze, and rich green-and-gold color contrast. Add a blurred foreground leaf or plant along the right edge to frame the composition. The lower background should suggest a busy café or cocktail lounge with indistinct people, but keep them heavily out of focus. Photorealistic, elegant lifestyle photography, moody yet sun-drenched, shot from a low angle looking upward at the raised glass, high detail on condensation, glass reflections, and the luminous drink.', 'UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Golden Cocktail in Greenhouse Bar UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 UI 与社媒 A cinematic vertical photo of a hand holding up a large balloon wine glass filled with a sparkling golden-yellow citrus cocktail in a lush indoor greenhouse bar. The drink is backlit by warm late-afternoon sunlight, making it glow translucent amber. Inside the glass there is 1 visible citrus wedge, and at the rim there is 1 fresh mint garnish cluster. The hand enters from the lower left, delicately gripping the stem, wearing 1 chunky translucent amber bracelet. The setting is dense with tropical greenery, hanging ferns, and vine-covered walls, with a bright greenhouse roof structure visible overhead and 2 warm exposed hanging bulbs softly glowing in the background. Use shallow depth of field with creamy bokeh, strong sun rays filtering through leaves, soft haze, and rich green-and-gold color contrast. Add a blurred foreground leaf or plant along the right edge to frame the composition. The lower background should suggest a busy café or cocktail lounge with indistinct people, but keep them heavily out of focus. Photorealistic, elegant lifestyle photography, moody yet sun-drenched, shot from a low angle looking upward at the raised glass, high detail on condensation, glass reflections, and the luminous drink. @FernandesK47117 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_ui tag_design tag_mockup tag_food tag_poster tag_portrait', 'https://x.com/FernandesK47117/status/2048183925294371147', '@FernandesK47117', 'published', NULL, 5142, 508, 259, 1116, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
