  ('prompt_evolink_ui_105', 'evolink-ui-105-multi-panel-image-board-template', 'Multi-Panel Image Board Template', 'Create a {argument name="grid layout" default="4x3"} borderless grid where each panel is an independent image of the {argument name="subject" default="a young woman"}. Maintain strong subject consistency across all panels, with consistent color and lighting. Depict {argument name="theme" default="childhood memories"} with a {argument name="mood" default="warm, nostalgic"} mood in {argument name="style" default="nostalgic cinematic realism"} style. No text. No gap.', 'UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Multi-Panel Image Board Template UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 UI 与社媒 Create a {argument name="grid layout" default="4x3"} borderless grid where each panel is an independent image of the {argument name="subject" default="a young woman"}. Maintain strong subject consistency across all panels, with consistent color and lighting. Depict {argument name="theme" default="childhood memories"} with a {argument name="mood" default="warm, nostalgic"} mood in {argument name="style" default="nostalgic cinematic realism"} style. No text. No gap. @aimikoda EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_ui tag_design tag_mockup tag_infographic tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/aimikoda/status/2048183782876778821', '@aimikoda', 'published', NULL, 5124, 506, 258, 1112, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
