  ('prompt_evolink_ui_109', 'evolink-ui-109-luxury-lifestyle-mustang-shot', 'Luxury Lifestyle Mustang Shot', 'A stylish young woman with {argument name="hair style" default="long wavy blonde hair"}, defined cheekbones, and a confident expression, wearing black sunglasses and a {argument name="clothing" default="thick white puffer jacket"} over a fitted black top, standing confidently in front of a {argument name="car" default="vibrant hot-pink Ford Mustang"}. She is posing with one hand slightly raised near her chest, exuding effortless attitude and elegance. The car is parked on a scenic coastal road lined with blooming pink cherry blossom trees and tall palm trees. Behind them is a calm sea under a dramatic overcast sky with soft clouds. Pink petals are scattered on the wet asphalt. A wooden bench is visible on the left side near the water. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, ultra-detailed skin texture, natural lighting reflections, Instagram-style luxury lifestyle shot, vibrant colors, moody atmosphere, 8k resolution --ar 9:16 --stylize 250', 'UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Luxury Lifestyle Mustang Shot UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 UI 与社媒 A stylish young woman with {argument name="hair style" default="long wavy blonde hair"}, defined cheekbones, and a confident expression, wearing black sunglasses and a {argument name="clothing" default="thick white puffer jacket"} over a fitted black top, standing confidently in front of a {argument name="car" default="vibrant hot-pink Ford Mustang"}. She is posing with one hand slightly raised near her chest, exuding effortless attitude and elegance. The car is parked on a scenic coastal road lined with blooming pink cherry blossom trees and tall palm trees. Behind them is a calm sea under a dramatic overcast sky with soft clouds. Pink petals are scattered on the wet asphalt. A wooden bench is visible on the left side near the water. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, ultra-detailed skin texture, natural lighting reflections, Instagram-style luxury lifestyle shot, vibrant colors, moody atmosphere, 8k resolution --ar 9:16 --stylize 250 @Just_sharon7 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_ui tag_design tag_mockup tag_fashion tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/Just_sharon7/status/2048095904138485962', '@Just_sharon7', 'published', NULL, 5052, 498, 254, 1096, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
