  ('prompt_evolink_ui_127', 'evolink-ui-127-recipe-infographic-layout', 'Recipe Infographic Layout', 'Create step-by-step recipe infographic for creamy garlic mushroom pasta, top-down view, minimal style on white background, ingredient photos labeled: "200g spaghetti", "150g mushrooms", "3 garlic cloves", "200ml cream", "1 tbsp olive oil", "parmesan", "parsley", dotted lines showing process steps with icons (boiling pot, sauté pan, mixing), final plated pasta shot at the bottom', 'UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Recipe Infographic Layout UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 UI 与社媒 Create step-by-step recipe infographic for creamy garlic mushroom pasta, top-down view, minimal style on white background, ingredient photos labeled: "200g spaghetti", "150g mushrooms", "3 garlic cloves", "200ml cream", "1 tbsp olive oil", "parmesan", "parsley", dotted lines showing process steps with icons (boiling pot, sauté pan, mixing), final plated pasta shot at the bottom @aiistudiocom EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_ui tag_design tag_mockup tag_food tag_logo tag_architecture', 'https://x.com/aiistudiocom/status/2051060312351342957', '@aiistudiocom', 'published', NULL, 4728, 462, 236, 1024, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
