  ('prompt_evolink_ui_128', 'evolink-ui-128-personal-color-analysis-graphic-board', 'Personal Color Analysis Graphic Board', 'Create a personal color analysis graphic using this portrait. Point out which season colour suits the subject best. Show side-by-side clothing color comparisons to highlight which colors suit the subject best. List out what texture/accessories/hairstyle suit the subject best. Make it visual-first, with short labels only and no paragraphs.', 'UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Personal Color Analysis Graphic Board UI mockup、社媒卡片、信息图和界面概念。来自 EvoLinkAI GPT-Image-2 案例库。 UI 与社媒 Create a personal color analysis graphic using this portrait. Point out which season colour suits the subject best. Show side-by-side clothing color comparisons to highlight which colors suit the subject best. List out what texture/accessories/hairstyle suit the subject best. Make it visual-first, with short labels only and no paragraphs. @ZaraIrahh EvoLinkAI GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_evolink tag_ui tag_design tag_mockup tag_portrait tag_fashion tag_typography', 'https://x.com/ZaraIrahh/status/2049730770474877234', '@ZaraIrahh', 'published', NULL, 4710, 460, 235, 1020, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
