  ('prompt_youm_7', 'youmind-7-profile-avatar-pastel-anime-morning-greeting-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Pastel Anime Morning Greeting Portrait', 'Create a vertical pastel anime social-media greeting illustration of a youthful androgynous character with {argument name="hair color" default="bright cyan blue"} fluffy bob-length hair, wearing a loose dark navy beret, an oversized navy haori-style cardigan over a white shirt, and a small blue crystal pendant necklace. The character is shown from chest up in a sunny softly blurred room by a window, warm golden morning light and bokeh in the background, holding one hand beside the cheek in a V-sign peace pose. Place a large soft-edged square privacy block over the center of the face, colored as a muted blue-to-pink gradient, hiding the facial features. Use glossy modern anime rendering, delicate linework, luminous highlights, soft sparkles, and a cute sticker-decorated layout. Add exactly 2 Japanese text stickers: a large puffy rounded headline at the upper left reading {argument name="headline text" default="おはようございます"} in blue and pink letters with a thick white outline, and a cloud speech bubble at lower left reading {argument name="bubble text" default="ぴっぴ"} with a small pink heart. Add exactly 3 sun doodle marks near the top headline: one simple yellow sun with rays above the hair, one small yellow burst near the left side, and one curved pink heart-arrow flourish at the lower right. Add exactly 4 small flower doodles scattered around the image, plus tiny plus signs, dots, hearts, and star sparkles for a cheerful morning sticker aesthetic. Use a vertical 9:16 composition, close crop, dreamy pastel palette, high detail, clean illustration, no photorealism.', 'Generates a cute vertical anime greeting portrait with Japanese sticker text, blue-haired character styling, and a soft privacy block over the face.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Pastel Anime Morning Greeting Portrait Generates a cute vertical anime greeting portrait with Japanese sticker text, blue-haired character styling, and a soft privacy block over the face.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a vertical pastel anime social-media greeting illustration of a youthful androgynous character with {argument name="hair color" default="bright cyan blue"} fluffy bob-length hair, wearing a loose dark navy beret, an oversized navy haori-style cardigan over a white shirt, and a small blue crystal pendant necklace. The character is shown from chest up in a sunny softly blurred room by a window, warm golden morning light and bokeh in the background, holding one hand beside the cheek in a V-sign peace pose. Place a large soft-edged square privacy block over the center of the face, colored as a muted blue-to-pink gradient, hiding the facial features. Use glossy modern anime rendering, delicate linework, luminous highlights, soft sparkles, and a cute sticker-decorated layout. Add exactly 2 Japanese text stickers: a large puffy rounded headline at the upper left reading {argument name="headline text" default="おはようございます"} in blue and pink letters with a thick white outline, and a cloud speech bubble at lower left reading {argument name="bubble text" default="ぴっぴ"} with a small pink heart. Add exactly 3 sun doodle marks near the top headline: one simple yellow sun with rays above the hair, one small yellow burst near the left side, and one curved pink heart-arrow flourish at the lower right. Add exactly 4 small flower doodles scattered around the image, plus tiny plus signs, dots, hearts, and star sparkles for a cheerful morning sticker aesthetic. Use a vertical 9:16 composition, close crop, dreamy pastel palette, high detail, clean illustration, no photorealism. PPP　AI動画好き YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_3d tag_sticker tag_anime tag_architecture tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/PPP_if/status/2053211592557490225#reversed-1', 'PPP　AI動画好き', 'published', NULL, 3360, 310, 160, 720, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
