VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_8', 'youmind-8-profile-avatar-cat-ear-hoodie-anime-city-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Cat-Ear Hoodie Anime City Portrait', 'Create a vertical anime-style street fashion illustration of {argument name="character description" default="a young woman with pale skin and long silver-white hair"} standing in the middle of a busy modern Japanese city crossing, surrounded by softly blurred pedestrians and tall buildings covered in colorful billboards. She wears an oversized {argument name="hoodie style" default="black zip-up hoodie with cat-ear hood, red piping, white drawstrings, patch emblems on the chest and sleeve, and bulky sleeves"}, a red graphic T-shirt with a simple white skull-like mascot face, and loose black cargo pants with a small red accent at the waistband. Her hood is up, forming sharp black cat ears, with a small ahoge strand of hair at the top and white hair falling around her shoulders; her face is intentionally hidden by a centered opaque pale beige square censor block. Pose her walking toward the viewer with a relaxed urban attitude, holding {argument name="left hand object" default="a black umbrella handle"} in one hand and {argument name="right hand object" default="a glossy black handbag"} in the other. Use a bright daytime Shibuya-like setting with crosswalk lines, glass towers, red and blue signage, atmospheric haze, depth of field, soft rim lighting, clean linework, smooth cel shading, fashionable youth-culture mood, and a polished GPT-image-2 anime illustration look.', 'Generates a vertical anime streetwear portrait of a silver-haired character in a cat-ear hoodie walking through a busy Japanese city crossing.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Cat-Ear Hoodie Anime City Portrait Generates a vertical anime streetwear portrait of a silver-haired character in a cat-ear hoodie walking through a busy Japanese city crossing.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a vertical anime-style street fashion illustration of {argument name="character description" default="a young woman with pale skin and long silver-white hair"} standing in the middle of a busy modern Japanese city crossing, surrounded by softly blurred pedestrians and tall buildings covered in colorful billboards. She wears an oversized {argument name="hoodie style" default="black zip-up hoodie with cat-ear hood, red piping, white drawstrings, patch emblems on the chest and sleeve, and bulky sleeves"}, a red graphic T-shirt with a simple white skull-like mascot face, and loose black cargo pants with a small red accent at the waistband. Her hood is up, forming sharp black cat ears, with a small ahoge strand of hair at the top and white hair falling around her shoulders; her face is intentionally hidden by a centered opaque pale beige square censor block. Pose her walking toward the viewer with a relaxed urban attitude, holding {argument name="left hand object" default="a black umbrella handle"} in one hand and {argument name="right hand object" default="a glossy black handbag"} in the other. Use a bright daytime Shibuya-like setting with crosswalk lines, glass towers, red and blue signage, atmospheric haze, depth of field, soft rim lighting, clean linework, smooth cel shading, fashionable youth-culture mood, and a polished GPT-image-2 anime illustration look. PPP　AI動画好き YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_portrait tag_ui tag_sticker tag_anime tag_fashion', 'https://x.com/PPP_if/status/2053211592557490225#reversed-0', 'PPP　AI動画好き', 'published', NULL, 3342, 308, 159, 716, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
