  ('prompt_youm_9', 'youmind-9-profile-avatar-golden-hour-cowgirl-selfie', 'Profile / Avatar - Golden Hour Cowgirl Selfie', 'Photorealistic golden hour selfie of a {argument name="subject" default="young woman"} lying in a field of dry golden hay, long wavy copper-red hair glowing in warm sunlight, soft freckles, glossy pink lips, subtle natural makeup, wearing a dark brown cowboy hat with a silver sheriff badge, {argument name="clothing" default="red and white gingham tied crop top"} with puff sleeves, low-rise western-inspired bottoms with faux fur trim and large vintage belt, visible belly piercing, relaxed smiling expression, holding a {argument name="phone color" default="bright pink"} smartphone while taking a selfie, warm sunset lighting, cozy country aesthetic, cinematic western fashion vibe, ultra detailed skin texture, soft sun flares, shallow depth of field, realistic iPhone camera quality, warm earthy tones, playful modern cowgirl aesthetic, highly detailed straw background, editorial social media photography style', 'A realistic golden hour selfie prompt featuring a modern cowgirl aesthetic in a field of hay with warm sunlight and skin textures.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Golden Hour Cowgirl Selfie A realistic golden hour selfie prompt featuring a modern cowgirl aesthetic in a field of hay with warm sunlight and skin textures.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Photorealistic golden hour selfie of a {argument name="subject" default="young woman"} lying in a field of dry golden hay, long wavy copper-red hair glowing in warm sunlight, soft freckles, glossy pink lips, subtle natural makeup, wearing a dark brown cowboy hat with a silver sheriff badge, {argument name="clothing" default="red and white gingham tied crop top"} with puff sleeves, low-rise western-inspired bottoms with faux fur trim and large vintage belt, visible belly piercing, relaxed smiling expression, holding a {argument name="phone color" default="bright pink"} smartphone while taking a selfie, warm sunset lighting, cozy country aesthetic, cinematic western fashion vibe, ultra detailed skin texture, soft sun flares, shallow depth of field, realistic iPhone camera quality, warm earthy tones, playful modern cowgirl aesthetic, highly detailed straw background, editorial social media photography style Miz YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_mockup tag_fashion tag_typography tag_cinematic tag_gufeng', 'https://x.com/mizq06/status/2053201310460293349', 'Miz', 'published', NULL, 3324, 306, 158, 712, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
