  ('prompt_youm_10', 'youmind-10-profile-avatar-lady-of-red-poppies-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Lady of Red Poppies Portrait', 'Create a cinematic fine-art portrait titled {argument name="title concept" default="The Lady of Red Poppies"}: a pale-skinned woman in strict side profile facing right, cropped from chest to top of head, with her face intentionally hidden by a centered opaque square overlay in a muted red-to-gray vertical gradient. She has a short smooth bob of {argument name="hair color" default="silver-white"} hair with wispy strands and heavy side-swept bangs, styled like a sculptural wig. Her head is crowned with exactly 8 red poppy elements: 1 large open poppy centered on the left front of the hair, 1 tall open poppy rising above the crown, 1 small curled bud on a thin stem at the far upper left, 1 small bud on the lower left side, 1 blurred red poppy in the background above the head, 1 open poppy partly visible on the upper right, 1 large cropped poppy at the right edge, and 1 lower-right red poppy petal cluster. The poppies have delicate translucent crinkled petals, dark centers, and thin dark curved stems emerging from the hair. Dress her in a minimalist high-collared {argument name="coat color" default="black"} coat or turtleneck with soft matte fabric, giving a somber fashion-editorial silhouette. Use a shallow depth of field with the hair and foremost poppy sharply detailed while the distant flowers and background are blurred. Set the scene outdoors in a misty gray atmosphere with a soft horizon and a low field of defocused {argument name="field color" default="red poppies"} near the bottom. Lighting is overcast, cool, and diffused, with muted tones except for saturated crimson flowers; composition vertical 3:4, subject slightly left of center, elegant surreal botanical portrait, photorealistic, high detail, painterly bokeh, melancholic and refined.', 'Generates a surreal fashion portrait of a silver-haired woman crowned with red poppies in a misty field, ideal for fine-art botanical imagery.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Lady of Red Poppies Portrait Generates a surreal fashion portrait of a silver-haired woman crowned with red poppies in a misty field, ideal for fine-art botanical imagery.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a cinematic fine-art portrait titled {argument name="title concept" default="The Lady of Red Poppies"}: a pale-skinned woman in strict side profile facing right, cropped from chest to top of head, with her face intentionally hidden by a centered opaque square overlay in a muted red-to-gray vertical gradient. She has a short smooth bob of {argument name="hair color" default="silver-white"} hair with wispy strands and heavy side-swept bangs, styled like a sculptural wig. Her head is crowned with exactly 8 red poppy elements: 1 large open poppy centered on the left front of the hair, 1 tall open poppy rising above the crown, 1 small curled bud on a thin stem at the far upper left, 1 small bud on the lower left side, 1 blurred red poppy in the background above the head, 1 open poppy partly visible on the upper right, 1 large cropped poppy at the right edge, and 1 lower-right red poppy petal cluster. The poppies have delicate translucent crinkled petals, dark centers, and thin dark curved stems emerging from the hair. Dress her in a minimalist high-collared {argument name="coat color" default="black"} coat or turtleneck with soft matte fabric, giving a somber fashion-editorial silhouette. Use a shallow depth of field with the hair and foremost poppy sharply detailed while the distant flowers and background are blurred. Set the scene outdoors in a misty gray atmosphere with a soft horizon and a low field of defocused {argument name="field color" default="red poppies"} near the bottom. Lighting is overcast, cool, and diffused, with muted tones except for saturated crimson flowers; composition vertical 3:4, subject slightly left of center, elegant surreal botanical portrait, photorealistic, high detail, painterly bokeh, melancholic and refined. Minuit YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_fashion tag_cinematic tag_gufeng', 'https://x.com/minuitIA/status/2053186454411415955#reversed-3', 'Minuit', 'published', NULL, 3306, 304, 157, 708, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_11', 'youmind-11-profile-avatar-candid-park-reading-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Candid Park Reading Portrait', 'Create an authentic candid daily-life photograph in a vertical portrait frame, a medium-full shot from a low ground-level angle of {argument name="subject" default="a young Japanese woman in her early 20s"} sitting alone on lush grass in a quiet city park during an overcast afternoon. She has naturally straight, fine {argument name="hair color" default="black hair"} falling just past her shoulders with a loose center part and a few wind-displaced strands; her face is completely obscured by a centered opaque rectangular {argument name="privacy block color" default="warm brown"} privacy block. She wears a long-sleeve ribbed {argument name="top color" default="cream"} knit top with a soft scoop neckline tucked into loose wide-leg {argument name="trouser color" default="muted sage green"} trousers. Pose her seated on the lawn with one knee raised and bent to the side, one hand resting in the grass near the lower left foreground, and an open paperback book or notebook spread across her lap with visible cream pages. Use soft shade-diffused cloudy daylight, gentle cool-green color grading, natural skin and fabric texture, shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh, blurred deep green lawn behind her, a dark out-of-focus tree trunk near the upper left, and a faint pale pathway blurred in the upper right. Emphasize documentary realism, imperfect candid posture, wind-touched hair, detailed grass blades in the foreground, no studio lighting, no posing glamour, no text, no extra people.', 'A realistic vertical lifestyle photo of a young woman reading on grass in an overcast city park, useful for candid editorial or documentary-style imagery.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Candid Park Reading Portrait A realistic vertical lifestyle photo of a young woman reading on grass in an overcast city park, useful for candid editorial or do