  ('prompt_youm_12', 'youmind-12-profile-avatar-candid-park-reading-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Candid Park Reading Portrait', 'Create an authentic daily-life photographic medium-full portrait of {argument name="subject" default="a young East Asian woman in her early 20s"} sitting alone on a soft grass lawn in a city park during an overcast afternoon. Shoot from a low ground-level angle, slightly to her side, with a shallow depth of field and natural candid composition. She has long, naturally straight {argument name="hair color" default="black"} hair parted loosely and falling past her shoulders, with a few stray strands around her neck and collarbone; her face is completely covered by a flat opaque square censor block in a warm medium-brown skin-tone color. She wears a fitted long-sleeve ribbed {argument name="top color" default="cream"} knit top tucked into loose high-waisted wide-leg trousers in {argument name="trouser color" default="muted sage green"}. She sits with her knees drawn slightly to one side, one hand resting on the grass for support, and an open {argument name="reading object" default="small book"} lying across her lap as if she is quietly reading. The background shows a calm urban park with green grass, mature trees, and a faint blurred pathway, all softly out of focus. Use cool green-gray overcast daylight, gentle even illumination, minimal hard shadows, realistic fabric texture, natural skin and hair detail, subdued colors, documentary realism, 35mm-style candid photography, vertical 2:3 framing.', 'Generates a realistic overcast park photo of a young woman sitting on grass with a book, useful for lifestyle or documentary-style imagery.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Candid Park Reading Portrait Generates a realistic overcast park photo of a young woman sitting on grass with a book, useful for lifestyle or documentary-style imagery.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create an authentic daily-life photographic medium-full portrait of {argument name="subject" default="a young East Asian woman in her early 20s"} sitting alone on a soft grass lawn in a city park during an overcast afternoon. Shoot from a low ground-level angle, slightly to her side, with a shallow depth of field and natural candid composition. She has long, naturally straight {argument name="hair color" default="black"} hair parted loosely and falling past her shoulders, with a few stray strands around her neck and collarbone; her face is completely covered by a flat opaque square censor block in a warm medium-brown skin-tone color. She wears a fitted long-sleeve ribbed {argument name="top color" default="cream"} knit top tucked into loose high-waisted wide-leg trousers in {argument name="trouser color" default="muted sage green"}. She sits with her knees drawn slightly to one side, one hand resting on the grass for support, and an open {argument name="reading object" default="small book"} lying across her lap as if she is quietly reading. The background shows a calm urban park with green grass, mature trees, and a faint blurred pathway, all softly out of focus. Use cool green-gray overcast daylight, gentle even illumination, minimal hard shadows, realistic fabric texture, natural skin and hair detail, subdued colors, documentary realism, 35mm-style candid photography, vertical 2:3 framing. ToroJushiAi YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_portrait tag_ui tag_game tag_typography tag_illustration', 'https://x.com/ToroJushiAi/status/2053173272846754036#reversed-0', 'ToroJushiAi', 'published', NULL, 3270, 300, 155, 700, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
