  ('prompt_youm_13', 'youmind-13-profile-avatar-romantic-paper-cut-couple-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Romantic Paper-Cut Couple Portrait', 'Create a romantic couple portrait in a layered paper-cut art style, standing together in a beautiful {argument name="setting" default="green park"}. The woman is wearing an elegant flowing floral dress in soft cream or pastel shades, and the man is wearing a stylish modern suit in neutral tones. Both are smiling gently and posing lovingly together. Surround them with lush green trees, colorful flowers, butterflies, birds, and a peaceful garden pathway with a small bridge and gazebo in the background. Use soft pastel colors, detailed paper texture, handcrafted 3D paper layers, warm lighting, and a dreamy whimsical atmosphere. Highly detailed, cute yet realistic facial features, elegant composition, storybook aesthetic, vertical portrait format, ultra high quality.', 'A creative prompt for a romantic couple portrait in a layered paper-cut art style, featuring lush garden details and a whimsical storybook aesthetic.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Romantic Paper-Cut Couple Portrait A creative prompt for a romantic couple portrait in a layered paper-cut art style, featuring lush garden details and a whimsical storybook aesthetic.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a romantic couple portrait in a layered paper-cut art style, standing together in a beautiful {argument name="setting" default="green park"}. The woman is wearing an elegant flowing floral dress in soft cream or pastel shades, and the man is wearing a stylish modern suit in neutral tones. Both are smiling gently and posing lovingly together. Surround them with lush green trees, colorful flowers, butterflies, birds, and a peaceful garden pathway with a small bridge and gazebo in the background. Use soft pastel colors, detailed paper texture, handcrafted 3D paper layers, warm lighting, and a dreamy whimsical atmosphere. Highly detailed, cute yet realistic facial features, elegant composition, storybook aesthetic, vertical portrait format, ultra high quality. K YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_3d tag_typography tag_illustration tag_storybook', 'https://x.com/ChillaiKalan__/status/2053161692952223947', 'K', 'published', NULL, 3252, 298, 154, 696, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
