  ('prompt_youm_16', 'youmind-16-profile-avatar-sleepy-cat-hoodie-anime-girl-in-bed', 'Profile / Avatar - Sleepy Cat Hoodie Anime Girl in Bed', 'Create a cozy nighttime bedroom scene in a semi-realistic photo background with a vivid anime sticker character composited into it. A sleepy chibi anime girl with {argument name="hair color" default="bright pink"} short bob hair and soft bangs lies tucked into a plush beige duvet, holding the blanket with both small hands and gazing drowsily forward with half-lidded starry blue eyes, a tiny catlike smile, and faint blush. She wears an oversized {argument name="hoodie design" default="cream cat-eared hood with blue paw-like eye spots, pink inner ears, and a dark navy pajama hoodie covered in neon pink and cyan triangle patterns"}; add cute geometric hair clips shaped like blue and pink triangles. Render the character as a crisp 2D anime cutout with thick white sticker outline and dark edge shadow, placed naturally on the bed. The room is warm and calming: rumpled pillows, soft beige bedding, a chunky knitted throw in the foreground, a wooden headboard, bedside table with a glowing fabric-shade lamp, potted plants near the window and headboard, dark curtains, and blurred city lights outside the window. Use warm amber lamp light mixed with cool blue night shadows, shallow depth of field, high detail fabric texture, peaceful bedtime mood, vertical composition, close medium shot from slightly above, cute and comforting atmosphere, no visible text.', 'Generates a cozy vertical bedtime scene with a chibi anime cat-hoodie girl composited like a sticker into a realistic warm bedroom.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Sleepy Cat Hoodie Anime Girl in Bed Generates a cozy vertical bedtime scene with a chibi anime cat-hoodie girl composited like a sticker into a realistic warm bedroom.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a cozy nighttime bedroom scene in a semi-realistic photo background with a vivid anime sticker character composited into it. A sleepy chibi anime girl with {argument name="hair color" default="bright pink"} short bob hair and soft bangs lies tucked into a plush beige duvet, holding the blanket with both small hands and gazing drowsily forward with half-lidded starry blue eyes, a tiny catlike smile, and faint blush. She wears an oversized {argument name="hoodie design" default="cream cat-eared hood with blue paw-like eye spots, pink inner ears, and a dark navy pajama hoodie covered in neon pink and cyan triangle patterns"}; add cute geometric hair clips shaped like blue and pink triangles. Render the character as a crisp 2D anime cutout with thick white sticker outline and dark edge shadow, placed naturally on the bed. The room is warm and calming: rumpled pillows, soft beige bedding, a chunky knitted throw in the foreground, a wooden headboard, bedside table with a glowing fabric-shade lamp, potted plants near the window and headboard, dark curtains, and blurred city lights outside the window. Use warm amber lamp light mixed with cool blue night shadows, shallow depth of field, high detail fabric texture, peaceful bedtime mood, vertical composition, close medium shot from slightly above, cute and comforting atmosphere, no visible text. ✨💖 きらりあ・ネオン 💖✨ YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_portrait tag_3d tag_sticker tag_anime tag_architecture', 'https://x.com/akakageAI/status/2053119934662943231#reversed-0', '✨💖 きらりあ・ネオン 💖✨', 'published', NULL, 3198, 292, 151, 684, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
