  ('prompt_youm_17', 'youmind-17-profile-avatar-rainy-sakura-schoolgirl-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Rainy Sakura Schoolgirl Portrait', 'Create a vertical cinematic photorealistic portrait of {argument name="character description" default="a Japanese high school girl with long dark purple hair"} crouching in the middle of a rainy city street, viewed from an extremely low wide-angle perspective with one loafer and white ribbed sock large in the foreground and her reflection visible in the glossy puddled asphalt. She wears {argument name="school uniform" default="a beige blazer, white shirt, gray necktie, red plaid skirt, white knee socks, and brown penny loafers"}, holding a transparent clear umbrella above her head with delicate pink cherry blossom petals scattered across the canopy and floating through the rain. Her face is softly obscured by a smooth rectangular blur, while her posture remains gentle and intimate. In her other arm she cradles {argument name="animal" default="a small fluffy gray-and-white kitten"} against her chest. The background is a misty modern urban street with tall buildings dissolved into pale gray bokeh, falling rain streaks, oversized suspended water droplets, ripples in puddles, and scattered sakura petals on the wet ground. Use a dreamy spring-rain atmosphere, soft diffused overcast light, shallow depth of field, glossy reflections, realistic fabric texture, wet skin highlights, detailed umbrella ribs and raindrops, emotional quiet mood, high-end fashion editorial composition, ultra-detailed photorealism, 9:16 vertical aspect ratio.', 'Generates a dreamy photorealistic vertical portrait of a schoolgirl with an umbrella and kitten in a rain-soaked sakura city scene.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Rainy Sakura Schoolgirl Portrait Generates a dreamy photorealistic vertical portrait of a schoolgirl with an umbrella and kitten in a rain-soaked sakura city scene.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a vertical cinematic photorealistic portrait of {argument name="character description" default="a Japanese high school girl with long dark purple hair"} crouching in the middle of a rainy city street, viewed from an extremely low wide-angle perspective with one loafer and white ribbed sock large in the foreground and her reflection visible in the glossy puddled asphalt. She wears {argument name="school uniform" default="a beige blazer, white shirt, gray necktie, red plaid skirt, white knee socks, and brown penny loafers"}, holding a transparent clear umbrella above her head with delicate pink cherry blossom petals scattered across the canopy and floating through the rain. Her face is softly obscured by a smooth rectangular blur, while her posture remains gentle and intimate. In her other arm she cradles {argument name="animal" default="a small fluffy gray-and-white kitten"} against her chest. The background is a misty modern urban street with tall buildings dissolved into pale gray bokeh, falling rain streaks, oversized suspended water droplets, ripples in puddles, and scattered sakura petals on the wet ground. Use a dreamy spring-rain atmosphere, soft diffused overcast light, shallow depth of field, glossy reflections, realistic fabric texture, wet skin highlights, detailed umbrella ribs and raindrops, emotional quiet mood, high-end fashion editorial composition, ultra-detailed photorealism, 9:16 vertical aspect ratio. カズ☆ミ YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_fashion tag_architecture tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/jyu2DZfsL270551/status/2053096135091450327#reversed-0', 'カズ☆ミ', 'published', NULL, 3180, 290, 150, 680, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_18', 'youmind-18-profile-avatar-minimalist-single-line-social-media-avatar', 'Profile / Avatar - Minimalist Single Line Social Media Avatar', 'Please transform the input image into a minimalist single-line illustration suitable for social media avatars, with a default aspect ratio of 1:1. The subject can be a person, cat, dog, other animals, or plants. Based on the input subject type, automatically extract the most recognizable outer contours and key features, and summarize them into an artistic, minimalist single-line avatar/image illustration. The overall goal is not mechanical outlining, but retaining the subject''s charm and recognizability, reconstructing it with higher elegance and spirit through single lines. [Subject Processing Logic] If the subject is a person: retain key contours such as face shape, forehead, bridge of the nose, mouth transitions, chin, ears, hairstyle, keeping only necessary facial features to avoid cluttered details. If the subject is an animal: retain head shape, ears, muzzle contours, eye expressions, and the main flow of fur to avoid complex details. If the subject is a plant: retain the most recognizable morphological features of flowers, leaves, branches, or fruits, summarizing their posture and rhythm with simple lines. [Line Style Requirements] Lines must be smooth, rounded, stretched, bold, and natural, as continuous as possible, with a sense of breath and improvisation. Use soft arcs mainly, avoiding sharp, stiff, or rigid lines. Do not draw as a rigid logo-style outline. Lines should be simple but vital, with a touch of casual artistic flair, looking relaxed and collectible. [Composition and Avatar Adaptation] 1:1 square design. The subject should be clear, concentrated, and prominent. Centered or slightly centered composition with clear visual focus and sufficient white space. [Background Logic] Do not fix the color to one type (not always blue). Select dark-toned background logic based on the image''s temperament. Avoid neon or cheap bright colors. [Line Color Logic] Use thin white lines or light-colored lines contrasting with the background. [Embellishment Logic] Add small, random, colorful dots, arcs, stars, or geometric symbols to enhance spirit and fun. Keep them sparse and natural. [Overall Goal] Minimalist, light, modern, and artistic. Suitable for social media: eye-catching, recognizable, and fun. [Avoid] Realism, shadows, textures, complex scenes, mechanical outlining. Ratio 16:9', 'A comprehensive system-style prompt to transform any input photo into a minimalist, artistic single-line drawing optimized for social media avatars.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Minimalist Single Line Social Media Avatar A comprehensive system-style prompt to transform any input photo into a minimalist, artistic single-line drawing optimized for social media avatars.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Please transform the input image into a minimalist single-line illustration suitable for social media avatars, with a default aspect ratio of 1:1. The subject can be a person, cat, dog, other animals, or plants. Based on the input subject type, automatically extract the most recognizable outer contours and key features, and summarize them into an artistic, minimalist single-line avatar/image illustration. The overall goal is not mechanical outlining, but retaining the subject''s charm and recognizability, reconstructing it with higher elegance and spirit through single lines. [Subject Processing Logic] If the subject is a person: retain key contours such as face shape, forehead, bridge of the nose, mouth transitions, chin, ears, hairstyle, keeping only necessary facial features to avoid cluttered details. If the subject is an animal: retain head shape, ears, muzzle contours, eye expressions, and the main flow of fur to avoid complex details. If the subject is a plant: retain the most recognizable morphological features of flowers, leaves, branches, or fruits, summarizing their posture and rhythm with simple lines. [Line Style Requirements] Lines must be smooth, rounded, stretched, bold, and natural, as continuous as possible, with a sense of breath and improvisation. Use soft arcs mainly, avoiding sharp, stiff, or rigid lines. Do not draw as a rigid logo-style outline. Lines should be simple but vital, with a touch of casual artistic flair, looking relaxed and collectible. [Composition and Avatar Adaptation] 1:1 square design. The subject should be clear, concentrated, and prominent. Centered or slightly centered composition with clear visual focus and sufficient white space. [Background Logic] Do not fix the color to one type (not always blue). Select dark-toned background logic based on the image''s temperament. Avoid neon or cheap bright colors. [Line Color Logic] Use thin white lines or light-colored lines contrasting with the background. [Embellishment Logic] Add small, random, colorful dots, arcs, stars, or geometric symbols to enhance spirit and fun. Keep them sparse and natural. [Overall Goal] Minimalist, light, modern, and artistic. Suitable for social media: eye-catching, recognizable, and fun. [Avoid] Realism, shadows, textures, complex scenes, mechanical outlining. Ratio 16:9 小小东 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_logo tag_scifi tag_typography tag_illustration', 'https://x.com/xiaoxiaodong01/status/2053081717716758576', '小小东', 'published', NULL, 3162, 288, 149, 676, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_19', 'youmind-19-profile-avatar-candid-morning-bedroom-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Candid Morning Bedroom Portrait', 'Create a vertical close-medium authentic daily-life photograph of {argument name="subject" default="a young Japanese woman in her early 20s"} sitting sideways on the edge of an unmade bed in a small bedroom on an ordinary morning. Shoot from a slightly elevated three-quarter angle, as if captured candidly, with her posture relaxed and sleepy, leaning forward a little, knees together, one hand resting on her knee and the other loosely holding a dark smartphone near her thigh. Her face is intentionally obscured by a soft rectangular privacy blur, while her naturally straight black hair is loosely gathered and messy from sleep, with stray strands around her cheek and neck. She wears {argument name="sleepwear" default="an oversized loose white cotton T-shirt and light gray soft shorts"}, unstyled and casual. The room feels lived-in: there is exactly 1 large window on the left with bright morning daylight, exactly 1 potted plant on the windowsill, exactly 1 small green bottle near the window, exactly 1 cluttered bedside table with small bottles, jars, and daily items, and an unmade bed with cream pillows and {argument name="blanket color" default="muted sage green"} rumpled bedding. Use soft directional morning window light from the left, a cool-to-warm transition, visible dust and haze, gentle shadows across the shirt and legs, realistic skin texture on the hands and collarbone, natural fabric wrinkles, shallow depth of field, muted colors, slight grain, documentary realism, no posing, no glamour styling, no makeup, no artificial studio lighting.', 'Generates a realistic vertical lifestyle photo of a sleepy young woman sitting on an unmade bed in soft morning window light.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Candid Morning Bedroom Portrait Generates a realistic vertical lifestyle photo of a sleepy young woman sitt