High-quality 3D CG character rendering, semi-realistic anime style, exquisite character modeling, realistic skin subsurface scattering, fine hair rendering, soft knit material, cinematic soft light, shallow depth of field, fine highlights, clean background, high-end game character CG. Ratio 9:16.', 'A high-end 3D character portrait prompt for an elegant female character in a cozy indoor setting, featuring high-quality textures and cinematic lighting.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - 3D CG Oriental Fantasy Female Character A high-end 3D character portrait prompt for an elegant female character in a cozy indoor setting, featuring high-quality textures and cinematic lighting.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 An adult East Asian fantasy female character, 3D CG style, close-up half-body portrait composition. The character sits on a soft sofa, with the camera looking down from a slightly high angle. The character leans slightly forward toward the lens, with a natural, quiet, slightly lazy, and soft sexy aura. She has a delicate and beautiful face, fair and fine skin, three-dimensional but soft facial features, clear and charming eyes, {argument name="eye color" default="ice blue"} eyes with fine highlights, long eyelashes, natural rosy lip color, slightly moist lips, and a gentle, quiet, slightly detached expression. She has {argument name="hair color" default="silver-white"} long hair, smooth and fluffy, with side-swept bangs falling naturally, some bangs covering one eye, and her long hair braided into a loose thick braid over her shoulder, with rich hair details and a soft silk-like luster. She wears a {argument name="sweater description" default="white sleeveless high-neck knit sweater"}, which is thick and soft cable-knit, fitting the body curves to show a natural and elegant chest contour and slim waist; shoulders are exposed, paired with black knit long sleeves / off-the-shoulder sleeves, creating a strong contrast between white and dark