ign on the left, and one small green diamond sign on the right. Use saturated cyan-and-white color grading, crisp anime linework, glossy cel shading, high contrast sunlight, sparkling dust particles, motion in the hair, and a polished gpt-image-2 anime key visual style. Aspect ratio 9:16, clean composition, no extra characters, no text overlays besides blurred environmental signage. Shami@AIイラスト YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_portrait tag_ui tag_anime tag_fashion tag_architecture', 'https://x.com/Shami293517/status/2052985418984116278#reversed-0', 'Shami@AIイラスト', 'published', NULL, 3072, 278, 144, 656, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
