  ('prompt_youm_24', 'youmind-24-profile-avatar-ethereal-anime-character-portrait', 'Profile / Avatar - Ethereal Anime Character Portrait', 'Reverse haze, diffused blur, soft focus, close-up shot of an {argument name="subject" default="ethereal and pure beautiful girl or boy"} inspired by the character {argument name="character name" default="Frieren"} from Frieren: Beyond Journey’s End. Blurred portrait and scenery, emphasizing the chaotic beauty of flowing dynamic hair. Extremely attractive appearance, dreamy and elusive atmosphere, Rembrandt lighting, high saturation, reflections and refractions, rich texture details, glowing bloom blur diffusion, low noise, subtle film grain texture, minimalist style, soft-focus aesthetics, emotional impressionism, avant-garde visual art aesthetics, cinematic luxury composition, masterpiece-level film aesthetics. CGI, Unreal Engine 5 rendering, Octane Render.', 'This prompt generates a soft, dreamy close-up portrait of an anime character with flowing hair and glowing lighting, perfect for high-quality artistic fan art and ethereal aesthetics.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Ethereal Anime Character Portrait This prompt generates a soft, dreamy close-up portrait of an anime character with flowing hair and glowing lighting, perfect for high-quality artistic fan art and ethereal aesthetics.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Reverse haze, diffused blur, soft focus, close-up shot of an {argument name="subject" default="ethereal and pure beautiful girl or boy"} inspired by the character {argument name="character name" default="Frieren"} from Frieren: Beyond Journey’s End. Blurred portrait and scenery, emphasizing the chaotic beauty of flowing dynamic hair. Extremely attractive appearance, dreamy and elusive atmosphere, Rembrandt lighting, high saturation, reflections and refractions, rich texture details, glowing bloom blur diffusion, low noise, subtle film grain texture, minimalist style, soft-focus aesthetics, emotional impressionism, avant-garde visual art aesthetics, cinematic luxury composition, masterpiece-level film aesthetics. CGI, Unreal Engine 5 rendering, Octane Render. Anissa YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_3d tag_game tag_anime tag_typography', 'https://x.com/SimplyAnnisa/status/2052978965841600854', 'Anissa', 'published', NULL, 3054, 276, 143, 652, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
