  ('prompt_youm_25', 'youmind-25-profile-avatar-voxel-chibi-cat-ear-girl', 'Profile / Avatar - Voxel Chibi Cat-Ear Girl', 'Create a single full-body chibi character render in a chunky low-poly voxel/pixel-art 3D style on a plain white background. The character is a cute petite girl avatar with an oversized head, tiny body, pale skin, huge glossy black eyes with white highlights, a small neutral mouth, and bright {argument name="hair color" default="neon green"} bobbed hair with straight bangs and two short segmented spiral pigtails. She wears large black cat-ear headphones with pointed ears, plus a small skull hair clip on the right side of her bangs. Add oversized purple rounded glasses. Her outfit is a school-uniform-inspired look: black blazer, white shirt, black necktie, green-and-blue plaid skirt, white socks, and black shoes. Behind her on the left side, attach a thin black fishing-rod-like stick or dangling accessory holding exactly 1 small orange carrot with green leaves, hanging beside her head. Pose her standing upright facing slightly to the viewer’s right with arms down, feet close together, cute toy-like proportions. Use visible square pixels, blocky edges, simple flat lighting, subtle ambient shadow, crisp silhouette, and a clean isolated character-design presentation.', 'Generates a cute voxel-style chibi avatar with neon hair, cat-ear headphones, glasses, school uniform, and a dangling carrot accessory.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Profile / Avatar - Voxel Chibi Cat-Ear Girl Generates a cute voxel-style chibi avatar with neon hair, cat-ear headphones, glasses, school uniform, and a dangling carrot accessory.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a single full-body chibi character render in a chunky low-poly voxel/pixel-art 3D style on a plain white background. The character is a cute petite girl avatar with an oversized head, tiny body, pale skin, huge glossy black eyes with white highlights, a small neutral mouth, and bright {argument name="hair color" default="neon green"} bobbed hair with straight bangs and two short segmented spiral pigtails. She wears large black cat-ear headphones with pointed ears, plus a small skull hair clip on the right side of her bangs. Add oversized purple rounded glasses. Her outfit is a school-uniform-inspired look: black blazer, white shirt, black necktie, green-and-blue plaid skirt, white socks, and black shoes. Behind her on the left side, attach a thin black fishing-rod-like stick or dangling accessory holding exactly 1 small orange carrot with green leaves, hanging beside her head. Pose her standing upright facing slightly to the viewer’s right with arms down, feet close together, cute toy-like proportions. Use visible square pixels, blocky edges, simple flat lighting, subtle ambient shadow, crisp silhouette, and a clean isolated character-design presentation. 악당수업 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_mockup tag_3d tag_game tag_fashion tag_illustration', 'https://x.com/YAYOFLAKE3/status/2052973917883830535#reversed-0', '악당수업', 'published', NULL, 3036, 274, 142, 648, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
