  ('prompt_youm_27', 'youmind-27-social-media-post-interactive-hand-drawn-doodles-overlay', 'Social Media Post - Interactive Hand-Drawn Doodles Overlay', 'Analyse the uploaded image and preserve the original subject, composition, and lighting. Do not alter the identity or structure of the main subject. Add {argument name="doodle style" default="playful, hand-drawn doodles"} that interact directly with the subject in the image. The doodles should {argument name="interaction type" default="mimic, follow, or exaggerate"} the shapes, gestures, or motion present—such as outlining poses, extending limbs, adding motion lines, or creating imaginative elements that “respond” to the subject.', 'An image-to-image prompt designed to add playful, hand-drawn doodles that interact with the original subject''s motion and pose.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Social Media Post - Interactive Hand-Drawn Doodles Overlay An image-to-image prompt designed to add playful, hand-drawn doodles that interact with the original subject''s motion and pose.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Analyse the uploaded image and preserve the original subject, composition, and lighting. Do not alter the identity or structure of the main subject. Add {argument name="doodle style" default="playful, hand-drawn doodles"} that interact directly with the subject in the image. The doodles should {argument name="interaction type" default="mimic, follow, or exaggerate"} the shapes, gestures, or motion present—such as outlining poses, extending limbs, adding motion lines, or creating imaginative elements that “respond” to the subject. simeon-sanai YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind', 'https://x.com/Naiknelofar788/status/2053327048257757258', 'simeon-sanai', 'published', NULL, 3000, 270, 140, 640, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
