  ('prompt_youm_28', 'youmind-28-social-media-post-tropical-bubble-tea-splash-action', 'Social Media Post - Tropical Bubble Tea Splash Action', 'Create a hyper-realistic vertical action photograph inside a modern bubble tea shop kitchen, filled with explosive summer tropical fruit milk tea energy. A young female bubble tea worker, {argument name="character name" default="anonymous barista"}, crouches low on the wet reflective floor in a dynamic wide-angle pose, one hand thrust toward the camera in extreme foreground and the other arm reaching upward, wearing a beige baseball cap, cream polo shirt with dark green collar and sleeve trim, black apron, loose white pants, and white sneakers; her long dark hair is in two braids, and her face is covered by a centered soft-edged square privacy blur. Around her, a large sealed plastic cup of orange mango milk tea with black tapioca pearls and a domed lid floats diagonally at the upper left, surrounded by a dramatic frozen splash of creamy orange liquid, droplets, ice cubes, and tapioca pearls. Count exactly 7 prominent fruit pieces suspended in midair: 3 orange-yellow melon or peach wedges, 1 halved passion fruit at the bottom left, 2 green grapes, and multiple small mango cubes treated as one scattered garnish group; include numerous black boba pearls on the floor and in the drink. The environment should show stainless-steel counters and glass display cases on both sides, bright circular ceiling lights, warm reflections, and a cinematic fisheye perspective with shallow depth of field. Use glossy wet-floor reflections, motion-freeze photography, high-speed splash details, sparkling droplets, sticky creamy texture, vivid tropical orange and yellow color palette, summer freshness, dramatic lighting, realistic skin and fabric texture, and an energetic commercial advertising style for {argument name="drink flavor" default="tropical mango fruit milk tea"}.', 'Generates a cinematic high-speed bubble tea shop action scene with a barista surrounded by mango milk tea, fruit, boba, and frozen splash effects.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Social Media Post - Tropical Bubble Tea Splash Action Generates a cinematic high-speed bubble tea shop action scene with a barista surrounded by mango milk tea, fruit, boba, and frozen splash effects.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a hyper-realistic vertical action photograph inside a modern bubble tea shop kitchen, filled with explosive summer tropical fruit milk tea energy. A young female bubble tea worker, {argument name="character name" default="anonymous barista"}, crouches low on the wet reflective floor in a dynamic wide-angle pose, one hand thrust toward the camera in extreme foreground and the other arm reaching upward, wearing a beige baseball cap, cream polo shirt with dark green collar and sleeve trim, black apron, loose white pants, and white sneakers; her long dark hair is in two braids, and her face is covered by a centered soft-edged square privacy blur. Around her, a large sealed plastic cup of orange mango milk tea with black tapioca pearls and a domed lid floats diagonally at the upper left, surrounded by a dramatic frozen splash of creamy orange liquid, droplets, ice cubes, and tapioca pearls. Count exactly 7 prominent fruit pieces suspended in midair: 3 orange-yellow melon or peach wedges, 1 halved passion fruit at the bottom left, 2 green grapes, and multiple small mango cubes treated as one scattered garnish group; include numerous black boba pearls on the floor and in the drink. The environment should show stainless-steel counters and glass display cases on both sides, bright circular ceiling lights, warm reflections, and a cinematic fisheye perspective with shallow depth of field. Use glossy wet-floor reflections, motion-freeze photography, high-speed splash details, sparkling droplets, sticky creamy texture, vivid tropical orange and yellow color palette, summer freshness, dramatic lighting, realistic skin and fabric texture, and an energetic commercial advertising style for {argument name="drink flavor" default="tropical mango fruit milk tea"}. serein YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_food tag_poster tag_portrait tag_ui tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/you1873118/status/2053270942374322524#reversed-0', 'serein', 'published', NULL, 2982, 268, 139, 636, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
