VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_29', 'youmind-29-social-media-post-cyberpunk-wanderer-above-the-sea-of-fog', 'Social Media Post - Cyberpunk Wanderer above the Sea of Fog', 'Apply the style and character reference of {argument name="style reference" default="image 1"} to the painting seen in {argument name="original painting" default="image 2"}, which is a famous painting of "Wanderer above the Sea of Fog". Retain the same stance as the man standing in the painting. Fog and clouds partially cover the view of the building below. The woman stands atop a post war Japan circa 2040. Architecture is modern and not futuristic. Abandonded buildings, a slightly destroyed Tokyo tower is in the background. There is no debis on the tower, it is slightly bent, as if it was hit by bombs. Her left leg is proped up on the ledge of the building and her right hand rests on her hip. Retain the same composition and vanishing point as seen in image 2.', 'A creative remix prompt that applies a specific character and style to the classic Caspar David Friedrich painting, set in a post-war 2040 Tokyo.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Social Media Post - Cyberpunk Wanderer above the Sea of Fog A creative remix prompt that applies a specific character and style to the classic Caspar David Friedrich painting, set in a post-war 2040 Tokyo.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Apply the style and character reference of {argument name="style reference" default="image 1"} to the painting seen in {argument name="original painting" default="image 2"}, which is a famous painting of "Wanderer above the Sea of Fog". Retain the same stance as the man standing in the painting. Fog and clouds partially cover the view of the building below. The woman stands atop a post war Japan circa 2040. Architecture is modern and not futuristic. Abandonded buildings, a slightly destroyed Tokyo tower is in the background. There is no debis on the tower, it is slightly bent, as if it was hit by bombs. Her left leg is proped up on the ledge of the building and her right hand rests on her hip. Retain the same composition and vanishing point as seen in image 2. code name: THE BEAST YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_ui tag_scifi tag_architecture', 'https://x.com/zabiisuto/status/2053250664822927810', 'code name: THE BEAST', 'published', NULL, 2964, 266, 138, 632, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
