pose, chin resting on hand, colorful balloons filling the background, white heart and small dash doodles"},{"position":"middle center","description":"close-up with both hands reaching toward the viewer in strong perspective, daisy embroidery visible, balloons and blue sky behind"},{"position":"middle right","description":"dynamic side pose balancing on one leg with the other leg extended high to the right, arm raised holding balloons, white smiley face doodle and swirl marks"},{"position":"bottom left","description":"low-angle waist-up pose with both arms raised triumphantly, balloons above her head, white curved motion lines"},{"position":"bottom center","description":"dramatic low-angle seated kick toward the camera, sandal sole large in foreground, one knee bent, balloons behind, white speech bubble doodle reading \"Hi\""},{"position":"bottom right","description":"close-up portrait holding a red balloon string near her mouth, big red balloon at left, white hearts and small smile doodle around her"}]},"text_and_doodles":{"visible_text_count":2,"visible_text_labels":["FLY","Hi"],"doodle_count":10,"doodles":"white hand-drawn hearts, smiley faces, curved motion marks, short radiating marks, playful speech bubble"},"color_palette":"{argument name=\"sky color\" default=\"vivid cobalt blue\"}, bright white clouds, pastel pink shirt, multicolored balloons, navy denim, clean white grid lines","lighting":"strong sunny outdoor daylight, high contrast, glossy highlights, clear summer atmosphere","composition_instructions":"make the collage feel like nine spontaneous snapshots from the same outdoor balloon photo shoot; keep the same outfit and hairstyle across all panels; preserve the blurred face mask consistently; emphasize motion, wind, joy, and playful handwritten doodles"} なずな‗62 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_3d tag_anime tag_fashion tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/nazuna_62/status/2053241854926434776#reversed-0',