  ('prompt_youm_35', 'youmind-35-social-media-post-gradient-music-festival-poster', 'Social Media Post - Gradient Music Festival Poster', 'A stunning music festival vertical social media poster with a clean white background, at the center a large beautifully rendered 3D acoustic guitar shape filled with a flowing liquid gradient in {argument name="colors" default="electric pink magenta lime green and violet"}, the guitar form slightly abstracted and organic with a glossy smooth inflated aesthetic, surrounded by floating gradient music notes hearts and sparkle diamond symbols in matching fluorescent colors, bold large serif display typography at the top reading "{argument name="festival name" default="INFINITE LOVE MUSIC FESTIVAL"}" mixing oversized black and gradient-colored letters, date and location info "{argument name="event details" default="2025 · JUNE 20–22"}" in clean minimal sans-serif below, tiny decorative star and spark motifs scattered across the white background, overall composition elegant yet high-energy, premium event poster quality, 9:16 vertical ratio', 'Generates a vibrant, high-energy vertical music festival poster with a 3D abstracted guitar and fluid liquid gradients.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Social Media Post - Gradient Music Festival Poster Generates a vibrant, high-energy vertical music festival poster with a 3D abstracted guitar and fluid liquid gradients.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 A stunning music festival vertical social media poster with a clean white background, at the center a large beautifully rendered 3D acoustic guitar shape filled with a flowing liquid gradient in {argument name="colors" default="electric pink magenta lime green and violet"}, the guitar form slightly abstracted and organic with a glossy smooth inflated aesthetic, surrounded by floating gradient music notes hearts and sparkle diamond symbols in matching fluorescent colors, bold large serif display typography at the top reading "{argument name="festival name" default="INFINITE LOVE MUSIC FESTIVAL"}" mixing oversized black and gradient-colored letters, date and location info "{argument name="event details" default="2025 · JUNE 20–22"}" in clean minimal sans-serif below, tiny decorative star and spark motifs scattered across the white background, overall composition elegant yet high-energy, premium event poster quality, 9:16 vertical ratio Easy A.I. YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_ui tag_logo tag_3d tag_typography tag_illustration', 'https://x.com/92digitalartArt/status/2053185267444392358', 'Easy A.I.', 'published', NULL, 2856, 254, 132, 608, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
