h Graphic Designer","map pin icon with Port Harcourt, Nigeria","link icon with linktr.ee/theibdouglas","calendar icon with Joined May 2022 and chevron"]},"tabs":{"count":5,"labels":["Posts","Replies","Highlights","Articles","partially visible fifth tab"],"appearance":"each tab label sits on a separate pastel brush-stroke highlight; Posts is selected with a blue underline"},"pinned_post":{"label":"Pinned","author":"Ib Douglas | Visual & LOGOFOLIO 2025 ☀️✨","body_lines_count":4,"body_lines":["This year didn’t have many logos, but they meant a lot.","Work, church, and life were busy, but my work tells my story."],"thumbnail_strip_count":3,"thumbnail_strip":["blue circular logo sketch","multicolor swirl logo sketch","green monogram logo sketch"],"decorations_count":9,"decorations":["small avatar at left","lollipop on left","blue star","purple candy","yellow star","castle at lower left","small castle at lower right","wrapped candy at top right","yellow star at right"]},"bottom_navigation":{"count":5,"items":["home icon highlighted blue","people/community icon","compose pencil icon","notification bell with red dot","large floating circular blue plus button over rainbow scribble at bottom right"]},"composition":"Create a faithful vertical mobile profile page screenshot where the clean profile UI is surrounded by playful doodles of castles, clouds, stars, candies, lollipops, rainbows, and marker strokes. Keep all text crisp and readable, with colorful emphasis on selected words and follower numbers."} Ib Douglas | Visual & Brand Designer YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_mockup tag_logo tag_game tag_typography', 'https://x.com/realibdouglas/status/2053179394332524853#reversed-0', 'Ib Douglas | Visual & Brand Designer', 'published', NULL, 2838, 252, 131, 604, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
