  ('prompt_youm_37', 'youmind-37-social-media-post-realistic-cinematic-fashion-portrait', 'Social Media Post - Realistic Cinematic Fashion Portrait', 'Ultra realistic cinematic fashion portrait of a {argument name="subject" default="handsome young man"} leaning casually against a modern concrete railing outdoors, wearing a {argument name="top" default="beige and white vertical striped button-up shirt"} with sleeves rolled up and {argument name="pants" default="black tailored pants"}. Use the exact face structure, hairstyle, jawline, skin tone and expression from the reference face image. No cap, no sunglasses, no necklace. Thick textured black hair, light stubble beard, confident calm expression looking sideways. Warm golden hour lighting, shallow depth of field, luxury editorial vibe, blurred modern urban background with dark architecture and greenery. Sharp focus on face and shirt details, natural skin texture, soft shadows, premium Instagram/X aesthetic, DSLR photography, 85mm lens, ultra detailed, realistic proportions, clean composition, 4k.', 'A prompt that generates a luxury fashion portrait based on a reference face image, featuring golden hour lighting and an urban outdoor background.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Social Media Post - Realistic Cinematic Fashion Portrait A prompt that generates a luxury fashion portrait based on a reference face image, featuring golden hour lighting and an urban outdoor background.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Ultra realistic cinematic fashion portrait of a {argument name="subject" default="handsome young man"} leaning casually against a modern concrete railing outdoors, wearing a {argument name="top" default="beige and white vertical striped button-up shirt"} with sleeves rolled up and {argument name="pants" default="black tailored pants"}. Use the exact face structure, hairstyle, jawline, skin tone and expression from the reference face image. No cap, no sunglasses, no necklace. Thick textured black hair, light stubble beard, confident calm expression looking sideways. Warm golden hour lighting, shallow depth of field, luxury editorial vibe, blurred modern urban background with dark architecture and greenery. Sharp focus on face and shirt details, natural skin texture, soft shadows, premium Instagram/X aesthetic, DSLR photography, 85mm lens, ultra detailed, realistic proportions, clean composition, 4k. auqib YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_fashion tag_architecture tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/auqibhabib/status/2053176796087226470', 'auqib', 'published', NULL, 2820, 250, 130, 600, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
