  ('prompt_youm_39', 'youmind-39-social-media-post-gothic-maid-superhero-landing', 'Social Media Post - Gothic Maid Superhero Landing', 'Create a dramatic vertical anime illustration of {argument name="character name" default="Noel"}, a blonde gothic-lolita maid heroine performing a superhero landing in the middle of a ruined city street. She is crouched low with one fist smashed into cracked pavement, one knee forward, the other leg bent back, body leaning toward the viewer in a powerful dynamic perspective. Her face is deliberately obscured by a centered opaque tan square censor block, while her long curly {argument name="hair color" default="golden blonde"} hair explodes upward and outward from the impact, decorated with a frilly white maid headpiece. She wears an elaborate {argument name="outfit colors" default="black, pale pink, white, and gold"} frilled maid dress with layered ruffles, puffed sleeves, gold trim, a black bodice, pink-and-white apron details, white thigh-high stockings, glossy black Mary Jane shoes, and white cuffs with gold buttons. The environment is a cinematic disaster scene: tall shattered buildings forming a narrow urban canyon, broken stone slabs, dust clouds, debris and chunks of asphalt suspended in the air, impact cracks radiating from her fist, and a thin vertical blue-white energy beam descending from the sky behind her head. Use extreme low-angle perspective, intense motion, wind-swept fabric, flying rubble, volumetric sunlight breaking through smoke, high-detail anime rendering, sharp linework, glossy highlights, ornate costume details, dramatic backlighting, and a sense of explosive impact. Aspect ratio 3:4, full-body composition, no text.', 'Generates a cinematic anime gothic-lolita maid character crashing into a ruined city street in a superhero landing pose.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Social Media Post - Gothic Maid Superhero Landing Generates a cinematic anime gothic-lolita maid character crashing into a ruined city street in a superhero landing pose.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a dramatic vertical anime illustration of {argument name="character name" default="Noel"}, a blonde gothic-lolita maid heroine performing a superhero landing in the middle of a ruined city street. She is crouched low with one fist smashed into cracked pavement, one knee forward, the other leg bent back, body leaning toward the viewer in a powerful dynamic perspective. Her face is deliberately obscured by a centered opaque tan square censor block, while her long curly {argument name="hair color" default="golden blonde"} hair explodes upward and outward from the impact, decorated with a frilly white maid headpiece. She wears an elaborate {argument name="outfit colors" default="black, pale pink, white, and gold"} frilled maid dress with layered ruffles, puffed sleeves, gold trim, a black bodice, pink-and-white apron details, white thigh-high stockings, glossy black Mary Jane shoes, and white cuffs with gold buttons. The environment is a cinematic disaster scene: tall shattered buildings forming a narrow urban canyon, broken stone slabs, dust clouds, debris and chunks of asphalt suspended in the air, impact cracks radiating from her fist, and a thin vertical blue-white energy beam descending from the sky behind her head. Use extreme low-angle perspective, intense motion, wind-swept fabric, flying rubble, volumetric sunlight breaking through smoke, high-detail anime rendering, sharp linework, glossy highlights, ornate costume details, dramatic backlighting, and a sense of explosive impact. Aspect ratio 3:4, full-body composition, no text. mario YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_ui tag_3d tag_anime tag_fashion tag_architecture tag_typography', 'https://x.com/mario335599/status/2053155609357480424#reversed-0', 'mario', 'published', NULL, 2784, 246, 128, 592, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
