  ('prompt_youm_40', 'youmind-40-social-media-post-gothic-anime-superhero-landing', 'Social Media Post - Gothic Anime Superhero Landing', 'Create a dramatic vertical anime illustration of {argument name="character name" default="a gothic twin-tail schoolgirl"} performing a powerful superhero landing in a shattered urban crater. She is centered in a low-angle dynamic pose with one fist smashed into cracked pavement, one knee down, the other leg raised forward, conveying explosive impact and confidence. She has {argument name="hair color" default="black"} hair styled into two huge high curly twin-tails with glossy highlights, each tied with a {argument name="bow color" default="purple"} bow and pearl-like bead, with loose strands flying upward from the force. Her face is covered by a large soft-edged dark square censor block centered over the head, hiding all facial features. Dress her in a dark gothic street-school outfit: oversized black hooded jacket, deep purple top, purple-and-black plaid pleated skirt, black knee-high socks, and chunky black lace-up combat boots. The scene erupts with broken stone slabs, flying rocks, dust, sparks, and debris suspended around her, with a vertical surge of violet lightning and purple energy behind her. Use intense cinematic lighting, high contrast, rim light on hair and clothing, motion blur on debris, detailed rubble texture, dark purple and black color palette, dramatic manga/anime rendering, ultra-detailed digital painting, energetic composition, portrait orientation, no text.', 'Generates a cinematic anime girl in a gothic school outfit crashing into the ground with violet energy and debris, ideal for action character art.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Social Media Post - Gothic Anime Superhero Landing Generates a cinematic anime girl in a gothic school outfit crashing into the ground with violet energy and debris, ideal for action character art.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a dramatic vertical anime illustration of {argument name="character name" default="a gothic twin-tail schoolgirl"} performing a powerful superhero landing in a shattered urban crater. She is centered in a low-angle dynamic pose with one fist smashed into cracked pavement, one knee down, the other leg raised forward, conveying explosive impact and confidence. She has {argument name="hair color" default="black"} hair styled into two huge high curly twin-tails with glossy highlights, each tied with a {argument name="bow color" default="purple"} bow and pearl-like bead, with loose strands flying upward from the force. Her face is covered by a large soft-edged dark square censor block centered over the head, hiding all facial features. Dress her in a dark gothic street-school outfit: oversized black hooded jacket, deep purple top, purple-and-black plaid pleated skirt, black knee-high socks, and chunky black lace-up combat boots. The scene erupts with broken stone slabs, flying rocks, dust, sparks, and debris suspended around her, with a vertical surge of violet lightning and purple energy behind her. Use intense cinematic lighting, high contrast, rim light on hair and clothing, motion blur on debris, detailed rubble texture, dark purple and black color palette, dramatic manga/anime rendering, ultra-detailed digital painting, energetic composition, portrait orientation, no text. mario YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_portrait tag_3d tag_anime tag_fashion tag_typography', 'https://x.com/mario335599/status/2053155609357480424#reversed-1', 'mario', 'published', NULL, 2766, 244, 127, 588, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
