ture silhouette, delicate decorative motifs, museum archive atmosphere","central composition":"large vertical artifact slightly angled right, transparent golden circular data ring around the plinth, thin connector lines radiating to annotation cards","sections":[{"title":"artifact analysis cards","position":"surrounding the artifact in a radial grid","count":8,"labels":["01 天然色層","02 蟲蟻寓意","03 精湛雕工","04 玉質結構","05 清宮收藏","06 底座工藝","07 微雕細節","08 包漿痕跡"],"appearance":"each card is a semi-transparent frosted-glass rectangle with rounded clipped corners, small gold number, Chinese paragraph text, and a small inset macro photograph or museum photo connected by thin gold circuit-like lines"},{"title":"document information block","position":"lower left beside faint line drawing of the artifact","count":7,"labels":["名稱：翠玉白菜","類別：玉器","時代：清代（19世紀）","尺寸：長18.7公分／寬9.1公分／厚5.07公分","材質：翠玉（硬玉）","來源：台北故宮博物院","故宮藏001257"],"appearance":"small scholarly catalog text under the heading 文物資訊 with red square seal stamp"},{"title":"history timeline","position":"bottom horizontal band","count":5,"labels":["清代（19世紀）","~1948年","1965年","2000年後","現代研究"],"appearance":"gold timeline line with circular nodes, each node has a sepia or color thumbnail image below and short Chinese explanatory text, left vertical heading 歷史軌跡"}]},"callout card details":{"01 天然色層":"explains white-to-green natural jade color gradation with a leaf macro inset","02 蟲蟻寓意":"shows insects on cabbage leaves as auspicious symbols with a green macro inset","03 精湛雕工":"shows carved leaf ridges and delicate craftsmanship","04 玉質結構":"shows white jade texture and striations","05 清宮收藏":"shows a dim museum gallery display photo","06 底座工藝":"shows the dark wooden stand close-up","07 微雕細節":"shows slender leaf veins and tiny carved details","08 包漿痕跡":"shows aged surface patina and polishing marks"},"typography":"large expressive black Chinese calligraphy for the title, refined Song/Ming style Chinese body text, small uppercase serif English, careful museum-catalog hierarchy","color palette":"{argument name=\"color palette\" default=\"warm ivory parchment, antique gold, ink black, jade green, dark walnut brown, muted sepia\"}","rendering requirements":"ultra-detailed 4:5 vertical poster, photorealistic central artifact, clean high-end museum design, readable Chinese labels, elegant balance between ancient cultural relic and futuristic archive interface, no people, no clutter, national museum special exhibition poster quality"} Ryan Archive YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_portrait tag_ui tag_logo tag_3d tag_scifi', 'https://x.com/Ryan_5238/status/2053167347742171200#reversed-0', 'Ryan Archive', 'published', NULL, 2712, 238, 124, 576, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
