  ('prompt_youm_63', 'youmind-63-youtube-thumbnail-darwin-tree-of-life-podcast-cover', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Darwin Tree of Life Podcast Cover', 'Create a cinematic 16:9 podcast cover illustration in a dark Renaissance natural-history style, like an antique oil painting mixed with fantasy scientific engraving. On the left, show an elderly Victorian-era naturalist resembling Charles Darwin seated in shadow beside stacked leather-bound books, an open sketchbook full of botanical and animal notes, loose papers, brass instruments, and a dim study wall; his face is intentionally covered by a plain vertical brown rectangular block as if redacted. The center and right side open into a glowing seascape at sunset with a sailing ship near distant cliffs, birds in flight, and a huge symbolic tree of life whose twisting branches fill the sky. In the branches place exactly 13 visible natural-history elements: a jaguar or leopard, a monkey, a bear-like mammal, a perched bird, two small birds together, a pangolin-like animal, a fox or small canine, a sea turtle, a large tortoise, a fish, a lizard or reptile, a spiral shell, and a star-shaped botanical specimen. The right background should transition into a deep cosmic blue night sky with stars, a spiral galaxy, circular scientific diagrams, fossils, leaves, insects, roots, and ocean creatures, suggesting evolution, biodiversity, and cosmic time. Use dramatic chiaroscuro lighting, warm gold highlights, teal-green shadows, intricate engraved details, painterly textures, and a mysterious scholarly atmosphere. Across the lower center place large elegant gold Chinese title text {argument name="headline text" default="大自然没有设计师"}, with smaller gold subtitle text beneath it {argument name="subtitle text" default="达尔文与生命之树"}, flanked by thin ornamental divider lines and small decorative flourishes. Keep the typography crisp, centered, luxurious, and readable, like a premium science-history podcast cover. Overall palette: antique amber, dark forest green, deep teal, black, and luminous gold; high detail, cinematic composition, no modern objects.', 'Generates a cinematic Chinese podcast cover about Darwin, evolution, and the tree of life in an antique natural-history oil-painting style.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Darwin Tree of Life Podcast Cover Generates a cinematic Chinese podcast cover about Darwin, evolution, and the tree of life in an antique natural-history oil-painting style.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a cinematic 16:9 podcast cover illustration in a dark Renaissance natural-history style, like an antique oil painting mixed with fantasy scientific engraving. On the left, show an elderly Victorian-era naturalist resembling Charles Darwin seated in shadow beside stacked leather-bound books, an open sketchbook full of botanical and animal notes, loose papers, brass instruments, and a dim study wall; his face is intentionally covered by a plain vertical brown rectangular block as if redacted. The center and right side open into a glowing seascape at sunset with a sailing ship near distant cliffs, birds in flight, and a huge symbolic tree of life whose twisting branches fill the sky. In the branches place exactly 13 visible natural-history elements: a jaguar or leopard, a monkey, a bear-like mammal, a perched bird, two small birds together, a pangolin-like animal, a fox or small canine, a sea turtle, a large tortoise, a fish, a lizard or reptile, a spiral shell, and a star-shaped botanical specimen. The right background should transition into a deep cosmic blue night sky with stars, a spiral galaxy, circular scientific diagrams, fossils, leaves, insects, roots, and ocean creatures, suggesting evolution, biodiversity, and cosmic time. Use dramatic chiaroscuro lighting, warm gold highlights, teal-green shadows, intricate engraved details, painterly textures, and a mysterious scholarly atmosphere. Across the lower center place large elegant gold Chinese title text {argument name="headline text" default="大自然没有设计师"}, with smaller gold subtitle text beneath it {argument name="subtitle text" default="达尔文与生命之树"}, flanked by thin ornamental divider lines and small decorative flourishes. Keep the typography crisp, centered, luxurious, and readable, like a premium science-history podcast cover. Overall palette: antique amber, dark forest green, deep teal, black, and luminous gold; high detail, cinematic composition, no modern objects. dapenti YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_logo tag_infographic tag_typography tag_cinematic tag_illustration', 'https://x.com/dapenti/status/2052267034055246138#reversed-1', 'dapenti', 'published', NULL, 2352, 198, 104, 496, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_64', 'youmind-64-youtube-thumbnail-li-keyong-shatuo-dna-podcast-cover', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Li Keyong Shatuo DNA Podcast Cover', '{"type":"cinematic historical podcast cover and documentary thumbnail","aspect_ratio":"16:9 widescreen","language":"Chinese visible typography","style":"epic dark-gold historical documentary design, premium podcast cover, photorealistic composite, ancient Chinese imperial drama mixed with scientific genetics infographic, high contrast chiaroscuro, teal blue versus amber gold color grading, smoky atmosphere, subtle parchment texture, engraved map lines, elegant serif Chinese title typography","main_title":"{argument name=\"main title\" default=\"晋王的基因地图：李克用与沙陀之谜\"}","subtitle":"{argument name=\"subtitle\" default=\"古DNA如何重绘晚唐沙陀的来源与混合历史\"}","central_concept":"A grand visual explanation of an ancient DNA study about Li Keyong and the Shatuo people, combining Tang dynasty frontier politics, migration routes, burial archaeology, and genetic ancestry proportions.","layout":{"background":"split historical landscape: left half is cold blue northeastern grassland with faint mountains, horse caravans, map grid lines and glowing route traces; right half is warm golden western grassland and ruined fortress landscape with a great wall, watchtower, cave tombs, stone statues and desert haze; the middle horizon glows where the two regions converge","foreground_subject":{"position":"far left occupying about one quarter of the canvas","description":"a powerful late Tang / Jin prince warlord in ornate dark embroidered robe, fur mantle, jeweled belt, ceremonial hair crown and gold accessories, standing in three-quarter pose; face intentionally obscured by a plain rectangular blur block","side_name_plate":"{argument name=\"left name plate text\" default=\"李克用 晋沙陀领袖\"}"},"top_title":{"position":"upper center to upper right","appearance":"very large embossed metallic gold Chinese characters with subtle shadow and weathered texture","text":"{argument name=\"main title\" default=\"晋王的基因地图：李克用与沙陀之谜\"}"},"subtitle_band":{"position":"under main title","appearance":"thin horizontal divider lines on both sides, smaller white-gold Chinese text","text":"{argument name=\"subtitle\" default=\"古DNA如何重绘晚唐沙陀的来源与混合历史\"}"},"labeled_regions":{"count":2,"items":[{"position":"left-middle","label":"东部草原\n东北亚","visual":"blue map zone with glowing migration dots and route lines"},{"position":"right-middle","label":"西部草原\n欧亚大陆腹地","visual":"orange map zone with caravan silhouettes and desert fortress ruins"}]},"genetics_infographic":{"position":"lower center","description":"a luminous vertical DNA double helix at the center, acting as the meeting point of the two ancestry streams; orange and blue particle clouds merge around it","center_label":"汇合·融合","charts":{"count":2,"items":[{"position":"lower-left of center","type":"blue donut chart","value":"53.4%","label":"古代东北亚祖源"},{"position":"lower-right of center","type":"gold donut chart","value":"46.6%","label":"西部草原祖源"}]},"bottom_statement":{"position":"bottom center inside a decorative gold-outlined plaque","text":"沙陀并非单一血缘共同体"}},"right_vertical_label":{"position":"right edge beside tomb ruins","text":"{argument name=\"right vertical label text\" default=\"山西晋侯墓葬群\"}"},"decorative_science_elements":{"count":5,"items":["faint DNA helix diagram in the upper right","handwritten Chinese annotation marks across the sky","transparent scientific chart grid behind the landscape","thin glowing migration paths crossing the map","small scatterplot-style genetic data points near the bottom center"]},"composition_notes":"Keep all text legible, balanced for a YouTube/podcast cover at thumbnail size. Use cinematic depth, realistic lighting, ancient manuscript details, golden engraved borders, and an authoritative historical mystery tone. Avoid modern UI chrome, avoid cartoon style, avoid clutter over the main title."}', 'Generates a cinematic Chinese historical podcast cover combining Tang dynasty frontier imagery with ancient DNA ancestry infographics.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Li Keyong Shatuo DNA Podcast Cover Generates a cinematic Chinese historical podcast cover combining Tang dynasty frontier imagery with ancient DNA ancestry infographics.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 {"type":"cinematic historical podcast cover and documentary thumbnail","aspect_ratio":"16:9 widescreen","language":"Chinese visible typography","style":"epic dark-gold historical documentary design, premium podcast cover, photorealistic composite, ancient Chinese imperial drama mixed with scientific genetics infographic, high contrast chiaroscuro, teal blue versus amber gold color grading, smoky atmosphere, subtle parchment texture, engraved map lines, elegant serif Chinese title typography","main_title":"{argument name=\"main title\" default=\"晋王的基因地图：李克用与沙陀之谜\"}","subtitle":"{argument name=\"subtitle\" default=\"古DNA如何重绘晚唐沙陀的来源与混合历史\"}","central_concept":"A grand visual explanation of an ancient DNA study about Li Keyong and the Shatuo people, combining Tang dynasty frontier politics, migration routes, burial archaeology, and genetic ancestry proportions.","layout":{"background":"split historical landscape: left half is cold blue northeastern grassland with faint mountains, horse caravans, map grid lines and glowing route traces; right half is warm golden western grassland and ruined fortress landscape with a great wall, watchtower, cave tombs, stone statues and desert haze; the middle horizon glows where the two regions converge","foreground_subject":{"position":"far left occupying about one quarter of the canvas","description":"a powerful late Tang / Jin prince warlord in ornate dark embroidered robe, fur mantle, jeweled belt, ceremonial hair crown and gold accessories, standing in three-quarter pose; face intentionally obscured by a plain rectangular blur block","side_name_plate":"{argument name=\"left name plate text\" default=\"李克用 晋沙陀领袖\"