rical mystery tone. Avoid modern UI chrome, avoid cartoon style, avoid clutter over the main title."} dapenti YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_ui tag_mockup tag_infographic tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/dapenti/status/2052267034055246138#reversed-0', 'dapenti', 'published', NULL, 2334, 196, 103, 492, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
