  ('prompt_youm_65', 'youmind-65-youtube-thumbnail-surreal-macro-selfie-with-doodles', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Surreal Macro Selfie with Doodles', 'Creative macro photography. A person lying flat on the ground face-up, beside a giant naturally colored {argument name="animal" default="ANIMAL"} also lying flat on the ground. Both looking directly upward into the camera with blinking expressive eyes. Fisheye lens, top-down overhead selfie perspective, as if both are taking a selfie together. Pure {argument name="background color" default="USER_COLOR"} solid background decorated with hand-drawn cartoon cute creative doodle lines. Behind both subjects, oversized bold semi-transparent white block letters read "{argument name="background text" default="BG_TEXT"}". At the top-left, ultra-fine sans-serif white font reads "{{TOP_LEFT}}". At the top-center, "2026". At the top-right, "{{TOP_RIGHT}}". At the bottom-left, "{{BOTTOM_TEXT}}". At the bottom-right, "{{BOTTOM_TEXT}}". All text is ultra-fine sans-serif white, consistent in size and weight across all images.', 'A creative prompt for generating surreal macro photography featuring a person and a giant animal taking an overhead selfie, embellished with playful hand-drawn doodles and bold text.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Surreal Macro Selfie with Doodles A creative prompt for generating surreal macro photography featuring a person and a giant animal taking an overhead selfie, embellished with playful hand-drawn doodles and bold text.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Creative macro photography. A person lying flat on the ground face-up, beside a giant naturally colored {argument name="animal" default="ANIMAL"} also lying flat on the ground. Both looking directly upward into the camera with blinking expressive eyes. Fisheye lens, top-down overhead selfie perspective, as if both are taking a selfie together. Pure {argument name="background color" default="USER_COLOR"} solid background decorated with hand-drawn cartoon cute creative doodle lines. Behind both subjects, oversized bold semi-transparent white block letters read "{argument name="background text" default="BG_TEXT"}". At the top-left, ultra-fine sans-serif white font reads "{{TOP_LEFT}}". At the top-center, "2026". At the top-right, "{{TOP_RIGHT}}". At the bottom-left, "{{BOTTOM_TEXT}}". At the bottom-right, "{{BOTTOM_TEXT}}". All text is ultra-fine sans-serif white, consistent in size and weight across all images. SaaS Junction ✦ Daily AI News & Prompts YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_typography tag_cinematic tag_illustration tag_gufeng', 'https://x.com/SaasJunctionHQ/status/2051778829467971895', 'SaaS Junction ✦ Daily AI News & Prompts', 'published', NULL, 2316, 194, 102, 488, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
