ll-width comic caption banner","text":"{argument name=\"footer text\" default=\"日本、広すぎ問題 😂💦 どこに住むかで季節が違う説www\"}","style":"white jagged speech-bubble strip with thick black border, bold black Japanese text, red emphasis on 季節が違う, laughing-with-sweat emoji"},"overall_style":"Japanese meme infographic, chaotic but readable, three horizontal bands separated by white borders, dramatic typography, crisp vector-cartoon icons mixed with photo-like city detail, vivid blue/yellow/teal palette, playful exaggerated disaster-weather humor"} はく | ずぼらデザイン×AI YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_ui tag_logo tag_3d tag_sticker tag_anime tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/zubora_designer/status/2051309591162667198#reversed-0', 'はく | ずぼらデザイン×AI', 'published', NULL, 2298, 192, 101, 484, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
