VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_75', 'youmind-75-youtube-thumbnail-japanese-katsudon-diet-thumbnail', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Japanese Katsudon Diet Thumbnail', 'Create a bright, high-impact Japanese YouTube thumbnail about diet-friendly eating, in a clean split composition. The left half is a white background filled with oversized bold Japanese headline text stacked vertically and diagonally for maximum readability: the top line says "カツ丼" in huge vivid orange with a thick white outline and soft drop shadow, below it "食べても" in dark brown, then "太らない方法" in hot pink with a white outline and a yellow underline swoosh, and at the bottom a gigantic red-orange "5" with white outline next to "選!" in dark brown with a white outline. Add small yellow sparkle accents and comic-style emphasis marks around the headline. In the lower left corner, place a simple flat illustration of 1 smiling woman from the waist up wearing a yellow tank top, brown hair tied back in a ponytail, making an OK hand gesture, set over a pale yellow circle. The right half shows a close-up, appetizing katsudon bowl photographed in warm light: 1 ceramic bowl with blue vertical stripe patterns, filled with sliced golden-brown breaded pork cutlet over egg and onion on rice, glossy sauce, visible steam rising, and 1 small green herb leaf garnish on top. In the upper right corner, add 1 white circular badge with a dotted yellow border containing the Japanese text "おいしく楽しく♪ 賢くコントロール!" in a friendly handwritten style, with yellow accent marks around the badge. Along the entire bottom, include a pale cream horizontal information strip with 5 circular icons and 5 labels separated evenly from left to right: 1 salad bowl icon with the text "バランスの良い食事", 1 scale icon with "カロリーを意識", 1 walking person icon with "適度な運動", 1 glass of water icon with "水分をしっかり", and 1 clock icon with "食べる時間を工夫". Use a glossy commercial thumbnail aesthetic, warm food photography, thick outlined typography, cheerful health-themed colors, and strong contrast optimized for social media click-through.', 'This generates a bold Japanese food-and-health YouTube thumbnail featuring a steaming katsudon bowl and five weight-control tips for eye-catching video covers.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Japanese Katsudon Diet Thumbnail This generates a bold Japanese food-and-health YouTube thumbnail featuring a steaming katsudon bowl and five weight-control tips for eye-catching video covers.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a bright, high-impact Japanese YouTube thumbnail about diet-friendly eating, in a clean split composition. The left half is a white background filled with oversized bold Japanese headline text stacked vertically and diagonally for maximum readability: the top line says "カツ丼" in huge vivid orange with a thick white outline and soft drop shadow, below it "食べても" in dark brown, then "太らない方法" in hot pink with a white outline and a yellow underline swoosh, and at the bottom a gigantic red-orange "5" with white outline next to "選!" in dark brown with a white outline. Add small yellow sparkle accents and comic-style emphasis marks around the headline. In the lower left corner, place a simple flat illustration of 1 smiling woman from the waist up wearing a yellow tank top, brown hair tied back in a ponytail, making an OK hand gesture, set over a pale yellow circle. The right half shows a close-up, appetizing katsudon bowl photographed in warm light: 1 ceramic bowl with blue vertical stripe patterns, filled with sliced golden-brown breaded pork cutlet over egg and onion on rice, glossy sauce, visible steam rising, and 1 small green herb leaf garnish on top. In the upper right corner, add 1 white circular badge with a dotted yellow border containing the Japanese text "おいしく楽しく♪ 賢くコントロール!" in a friendly handwritten style, with yellow accent marks around the badge. Along the entire bottom, include a pale cream horizontal information strip with 5 circular icons and 5 labels separated evenly from left to right: 1 salad bowl icon with the text "バランスの良い食事", 1 scale icon with "カロリーを意識", 1 walking person icon with "適度な運動", 1 glass of water icon with "水分をしっかり", and 1 clock icon with "食べる時間を工夫". Use a glossy commercial thumbnail aesthetic, warm food photography, thick outlined typography, cheerful health-themed colors, and strong contrast optimized for social media click-through. ふりー＠AI副業 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_food tag_portrait tag_ui tag_logo tag_anime tag_typography', 'https://x.com/freekwAI_gd/status/2050039335219830925#reversed-0', 'ふりー＠AI副業', 'published', NULL, 2136, 174, 92, 448, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_76', 'youmind-76-youtube-thumbnail-retro-game-style-japanese-event-banner', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Retro Game Style Japanese Event Banner', 'Create a bold Japanese event thumbnail in a retro 8-bit video game style on a clean white background with a black, white, and vivid yellow color palette. The composition is a single highly graphic poster packed with pixel-art decorations, thick black outlines, comic halftone dots, drop shadows, and arcade-inspired stickers. In the center, place an enormous headline reading “{argument name="main title" default="LOVART"}” in oversized block letters, bright yellow with a thick black outline, white border, and heavy shadow, slightly tilted and dominating most of the image. Above it, add a jagged white banner with black outline containing the Japanese title “{argument name="top banner text" default="AIデザイン運用勉強会"}”. Below the main title, place a black ribbon with yellow and white Japanese text reading “{argument name="subheading text" default="最新ツール実践 × プロの基礎力"}”. At the lower left-center, add a large rounded rectangular date panel in yellow with black outline and white trim, including a pixel calendar icon on the left and the text “{argument name="event date" default="5.10 (sat) 19:00 START"}” in huge black retro type. At the lower right, place a black spiky label reading “speaker” above the large yellow-outlined name “{argument name="speaker name" default="kats"}”. Surround the layout with exactly 11 decorative gaming elements: 1 pixel speech burst at upper left saying “LEVEL UP!”, 1 yellow lightning bolt near the top, 1 yellow question block with a black question mark at upper right, 1 pixel sword on the right side, 1 starburst on the right saying “GAME ON!”, 1 chibi pixel character jumping on the left in a yellow jacket with raised fist, 1 small black “1UP” life icon with three yellow hearts at lower left, 1 retro game controller beneath it, 3 groups of sparkle stars scattered around the composition. Add comic accents such as dotted halftone patches, angled yellow speed lines, small checkerboard strips, and a pixel cursor pointer near the subtitle. Include a stylized anime-like speaker avatar in the lower right corner wearing a black cap and black hoodie with yellow accents, face partially obscured or simplified, integrated like a streamer or event host badge. Make all Japanese and English text crisp, readable, and accurately typeset, with the overall feeling of a high-energy YouTube thumbnail or social media event banner for a design/AI workshop.', 'A bold arcade-inspired Japanese workshop thumbnail with crisp typography, ideal for social posts, YouTube covers, and event promotions.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'YouTube Thumbnail - Retro Game Style Japanese Event Banner A bold arcade-inspired Japanese workshop thumbnail with crisp typography, ideal for social posts, YouTube covers, and event promotions.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a bold Japanese event thumbnail in a retro 8-bit video game style on a clean white background with a black, white, and vivid yellow color palette. The composition is a single highly graphic poster packed with pixel-art decorations, thick black outlines, comic halftone dots, drop shadows, and arcade-inspired stickers. In the center, place an enormous headline reading “{argument name="main title" default="LOVART"}” in oversized block letters, bright yellow with a thick black outline, white border, and heavy shadow, slightly tilted and dominating most of the image. Above it, add a jagged white banner with black outline containing the Japanese title “{argument name="top banner text" default="AIデザイン運用勉強会"}”. Below the main title, place a black ribbon with yellow and white Japanese text reading “{argument name="subheading text" default="最新ツール実践 × プロの基礎力"}”. At the lower left-center, add a large rounded rectangular date panel in yellow with black outline and white trim, including a pixel calendar icon on the left and the text “{argument name="event date" default="5.10 (sat) 19:00 START"}” in huge black retro type. At the lower right, place a black spiky label reading “speaker” above the large yellow-outlined name “{argument name="speaker name" default="kats"}”. Surround the layout with exactly 11 decorative gaming elements: 1 pixel speech burst at upper left saying “LEVEL UP!”, 1 yellow lightning bolt near the top, 1 yellow question block with a black question mark at upper right, 1 pixel sword on the right side, 1 starburst on the right saying “GAME ON!”, 1 chibi pixel character jumping on the left in a yellow jacket with raised fist, 1 small black “1UP” life icon with three yellow hearts at lower left, 1 retro game controller beneath it, 3 groups of sparkle stars scattered around the composition. Add comic accents such as dotted halftone patches, angled yellow speed lines, small checkerboard strips, and a pixel cursor pointer near the subtitle. Include a stylized anime-like speaker avatar in the lower right corner wearing a black cap and black hoodie with yellow accents, face partially obscured or simplified, integrated like a streamer or event host badge. Make all Japanese and English text crisp, readable, and accurately typeset, with the overall feeling of a high-energy YouTube thumbnail or social media event banner for a design/AI workshop. kats@AI＆Creative YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_portrait tag_logo tag_game tag_sticker tag_anime', 'https://x.com/katsedi10/status/2050034358443225132#reversed-1', 'kats@AI＆Creative', 'published', NULL, 2118, 172, 91, 444, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
