y, and eight cut cards for planning a fantasy animation sequence.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Comic / Storyboard - Anime Storyboard Sheet Generates a professional anime production storyboard page with a main scene visual, scene summary, and eight cut cards for planning a fantasy animation sequence.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 {"type":"anime film storyboard sheet / production conte page","format":"clean printable A4 vertical layout, black grid lines, red accent labels, white paper background, professional Japanese animation storyboard template","header":{"work title":"{argument name=\"work title\" default=\"Scarlet Wizard / 緋色の魔法遣い\"}","episode":"{argument name=\"episode number\" default=\"01\"}","scene":"{argument name=\"scene number\" default=\"01\"}","duration":"{argument name=\"duration\" default=\"7 sec\"}"},"main scene visual":{"title":"SCENE VISUAL (INITIAL STATE)","position":"large widescreen panel across upper half","image description":"misty dawn fantasy mountain village, blue-gray early morning light, pine-covered hills and layered mountains in the distance, old timber houses with slate roofs, warm window lights, cobblestone village path, wooden fences, a church bell tower with a cross on the right, stacked firewood on the left. In the foreground a small silver-haired anime girl named {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"Alvina\"} chops wood with an axe beside a stump; she wears a pale simple dress, sandals, and a red flower hair ornament, quiet melancholic atmosphere, cinematic background art, detailed hand-painted anime style.","composition":"wide establishing shot with the character left of center, woodpile at far left, village and tower receding into mist, dramatic but subdued dawn sky"},"scene summary":{"title":"SCENE SUMMARY","count":4,"items":["1. Misty dawn establishes the village.","2. Alvina works alone by the woodpile.","3. Slow camera movement shows four years passed.","4. Quiet axe sounds define the morning."]},"cut list":{"title":"CUT LIST","total cards":8,"filled cards":4,"blank cards":4,"layout":"two rows of four storyboard cards beneath the main panel, each card has a red numbered box, time field, camera field, image thumbnail area, and cut summary lines","cards":[{"number":1,"time":"00:00 - 00:02","camera":"WIDE / STATIC","thumbnail":"wide view of misty mountain village at dawn with church tower and rooftops","cut summary":["Scene 01.","Misty village dawn."]},{"number":2,"time":"00:02 - 00:04","camera":"WIDE / SLOW DOLLY IN","thumbnail":"Alvina chopping wood near the woodpile in the village foreground","cut summary":["Alvina works","alone."]},{"number":3,"time":"00:04 - 00:06","camera":"MEDIUM","thumbnail":"medium shot of Alvina swinging the axe, wood chips and stump visible, determined tired expression","cut summary":["Axe strike","breaks silence."]},{"number":4,"time":"00:06 - 00:07","camera":"CLOSE","thumbnail":"close-up profile of Alvina''s silver hair and red flower ornament, face partly obscured by a gray censor-like square placeholder","cut summary":["Four years","have passed."]},{"number":5,"time":"blank line","camera":"blank line","thumbnail":"empty placeholder box labeled CUT IMAGE with faint diagonal guide arrows","cut summary":"blank ruled lines"},{"number":6,"time":"blank line","camera":"blank line","thumbnail":"empty placeholder box labeled CUT IMAGE with faint diagonal guide arrows","cut summary":"blank ruled lines"},{"number":7,"time":"blank line","camera":"blank line","thumbnail":"empty placeholder box labeled CUT IMAGE with faint diagonal guide arrows","cut summary":"blank ruled lines"},{"number":8,"time":"blank line","camera":"blank line","thumbnail":"empty placeholder box labeled CUT IMAGE with faint diagonal guide arrows","cut summary":"blank ruled lines"}]},"typography":"bold sans-serif uppercase English labels, red section headers, thin gray form lines, strong black borders, small neat production notes text","style":"highly legible storyboard planning document, anime concept art thumbnails, muted desaturated colors, cinematic fantasy realism, no extra pages, no watermark"} Naoyuki Okada / Scarlet Echoes🐲 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_ui tag_mockup tag_anime tag_architecture tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/naoyuki_okada/status/2053263197428428831#reversed-3', 'Naoyuki Okada / Scarlet Echoes🐲', 'published', NULL, 2100, 170, 90, 440, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_78', 'youmind-78-comic-storyboard-misty-medieval-village-establishing-shot', 'Comic / Storyboard - Misty Medieval Village Establishing Shot', 'Create a cinematic wide establishing shot of a quiet {argument name="setting" default="medieval European village square"} on a cold misty morning, rendered in realistic dark fantasy style. The scene centers on a circular stone well with a wooden frame, hanging rope, bucket, and small barrels beside it, placed on an uneven cobblestone path that forks between rustic half-timbered houses. Show at least four visible timber-and-plaster buildings: a large weathered two-story house on the right with a sagging shingled roof, porch, barrels, crates, and a small table; two smaller cottages on the left and midground with fenced yards; and a stone church in the background with a bell tower and cross. Add wooden split-rail fences, muddy grass patches, scattered stones, worn steps, smoke rising from chimneys, and distant tree silhouettes fading into fog. Use a muted palette of gray, brown, moss green, and charcoal, with overcast sky, damp ground, soft diffuse light, low contrast, subtle haze, and a slightly desaturated film look. No people are visible, making the village feel abandoned or early before dawn. Compose as a wide 16:9 storyboard frame with the well in the lower center foreground, buildings framing both sides, the church tower near the central background, and atmospheric depth created by mist and smoke. Overall mood: {argument name="mood" default="somber, quiet, and ominous"}.', 'Generates a cinematic dark-fantasy medieval village square suitable for storyboard, concept art, or scene-setting visuals.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Comic / Storyboard - Misty Medieval Village Establishing Shot Generates a cinematic dark-fantasy medieval village square suitable for storyboard, concept art, or scene-setting visuals.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a cinematic wide establishing shot of a quiet {argument name="setting" default="medieval European village square"} on a cold misty morning, rendered in realistic dark fantasy style. The scene centers on a circular stone well with a wooden frame, hanging rope, bucket, and small barrels beside it, placed on an uneven cobblestone path that forks between rustic half-timbered houses. Show at least four visible timber-and-plaster buildings: a large weathered two-story house on the right with a sagging shingled roof, porch, barrels, crates, and a small table; two smaller cottages on the left and midground with fenced yards; and a stone church in the background with a bell tower and cross. Add wooden split-rail fences, muddy grass patches, scattered stones, worn steps, smoke rising from chimneys, and distant tree silhouettes fading into fog. Use a muted palette of gray, brown, moss green, and charcoal, with overcast sky, damp ground, soft diffuse light, low contrast, subtle haze, and a slightly desaturated film look. No people are visible, making the village feel abandoned or early before dawn. Compose as a wide 16:9 storyboard frame with the well in the lower center foreground, buildings framing both sides, the church tower near the central background, and atmospheric depth created by mist and smoke. Overall mood: {argument name="mood" default="somber, quiet, and ominous"}. Naoyuki Okada / Scarlet Echoes🐲 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_ui tag_3d tag_anime tag_architecture tag_infographic tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/naoyuki_okada/status/2053263197428428831#reversed-2', 'Naoyuki Okada / Scarlet Echoes🐲', 'published', NULL, 2082, 168, 89, 436, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_79', 'youmind-79-comic-storyboard-alvina-anime-character-reference-sheet', 'Comic / Storyboard - Alvina Anime Character Reference Sheet', '{"type":"anime character reference sheet","title_text":"{argument name=\"character name\" default=\"ALVINA\"}","canvas":"wide horizontal white background with clean spacious margins, elegant fantasy design-sheet presentation, thin dark burgundy divider lines and small ornamental fleur-de-lis accents","style":"delicate Japanese anime concept art, soft watercolor shading, fine ink linework, pale warm lighting, refined character-design turnaround sheet","character":{"gender_age":"young petite girl, childlike proportions","hair":{"color":"{argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"very pale silver-white with pink underside tips\"}","style":"short tousled bob reaching the neck, wispy bangs, layered loose strands, red flower hair clip on the left side"},"face":"facial features intentionally hidden by a soft opaque pale beige square censor block in every portrait and expression crop","skin":"fair skin","accessories":"small necklace with tiny pendant, simple bracelets, red flower hair ornament","outfit":"{argument name=\"outfit description\" default=\"off-shoulder white midi dress with ruffled neckline, thin shoulder straps, loose bell sleeves, gathered waist, narrow brown belt, and soft vertical folds\"}","footwear":"brown strappy platform sandals with ankle straps"},"layout":{"top_center":"large serif uppercase name ALVINA in dark burgundy, with a thin horizontal line and small ornament beneath","main_turnaround":{"position":"left and center across the page","count":3,"views":[{"label":"FRONT","position":"left","description":"full-body front view, standing neutrally with arms relaxed, dress hanging straight to mid-calf"},{"label":"BACK","position":"center","description":"full-body back view, showing shoulder straps, back of ruffled neckline, brown belt, bob haircut with pink tips, and sandal backs"},{"label":"SIDE","positi