  ('prompt_youm_80', 'youmind-80-comic-storyboard-pokemon-trainer-profile-journal-poster', 'Comic / Storyboard - Pokemon Trainer Profile Journal Poster', 'Use the uploaded reference image as the exact identity for the main trainer character. Preserve the person’s facial structure, hairstyle, skin tone, expression style, body type, and overall likeness while transforming them into a beautifully illustrated anime-inspired Pokémon trainer poster in a nostalgic adventure-journal aesthetic.
