  ('prompt_youm_81', 'youmind-81-comic-storyboard-cinematic-anime-battle-poster', 'Comic / Storyboard - Cinematic Anime Battle Poster', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic anime movie poster of a female warrior inspired by the Attack on Titan universe, short black hair and a red scarf flowing in the wind, holding dual swords with ODM gear while flying through a destroyed city, a massive shadow of a colossal titan appearing through smoke and fog in the background, elegant double exposure layout with a large emotional side profile silhouette integrated into the environment, aerial destruction, ash particles, storm clouds, soft cinematic lighting, muted gray and brown colors, emotional and heroic mood, highly detailed skin and fabric textures, realistic leather combat outfit, dynamic action scene, Japanese movie poster aesthetics, photorealistic anime adaptation, dramatic depth, volumetric lighting, ultra-detailed, masterpiece, 8K, dark fantasy realism, vertical composition --ar 2:3 --stylize 750 Ultra-realistic dark fantasy anime poster, inspired by the post-apocalyptic Attack on Titan war, featuring a fierce young female warrior with messy black hair and intense green eyes using dual blades and ODM gear, dynamic action pose rushing towards the camera, massive colossal titans appearing through storm clouds behind destroyed walls, double exposure composition with a giant side profile face integrated into the battlefield, cinematic lightning, smoke, ash particles, burning city ruins, dramatic volumetric fog, gritty texture, highly detailed leather outfit, metallic reflections, rain-soaked skin, emotional expression of anger, epic scale, moody monochrome colors with slight orange embers, IMAX movie poster style, ultra-detailed, photorealistic, sharp focus, depth of field, 8K, masterpiece composition, dark cinematic lighting, realistic anime adaptation, vertical poster --ar 2:3 --stylize 750', 'Detailed prompts for creating hyper-realistic anime posters featuring fierce warriors and giant titans in a dark fantasy setting.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Comic / Storyboard - Cinematic Anime Battle Poster Detailed prompts for creating hyper-realistic anime posters featuring fierce warriors and giant titans in a dark fantasy setting.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Ultra-realistic cinematic anime movie poster of a female warrior inspired by the Attack on Titan universe, short black hair and a red scarf flowing in the wind, holding dual swords with ODM gear while flying through a destroyed city, a massive shadow of a colossal titan appearing through smoke and fog in the background, elegant double exposure layout with a large emotional side profile silhouette integrated into the environment, aerial destruction, ash particles, storm clouds, soft cinematic lighting, muted gray and brown colors, emotional and heroic mood, highly detailed skin and fabric textures, realistic leather combat outfit, dynamic action scene, Japanese movie poster aesthetics, photorealistic anime adaptation, dramatic depth, volumetric lighting, ultra-detailed, masterpiece, 8K, dark fantasy realism, vertical composition --ar 2:3 --stylize 750 Ultra-realistic dark fantasy anime poster, inspired by the post-apocalyptic Attack on Titan war, featuring a fierce young female warrior with messy black hair and intense green eyes using dual blades and ODM gear, dynamic action pose rushing towards the camera, massive colossal titans appearing through storm clouds behind destroyed walls, double exposure composition with a giant side profile face integrated into the battlefield, cinematic lightning, smoke, ash particles, burning city ruins, dramatic volumetric fog, gritty texture, highly detailed leather outfit, metallic reflections, rain-soaked skin, emotional expression of anger, epic scale, moody monochrome colors with slight orange embers, IMAX movie poster style, ultra-detailed, photorealistic, sharp focus, depth of field, 8K, masterpiece composition, dark cinematic lighting, realistic anime adaptation, vertical poster --ar 2:3 --stylize 750 أداة توليد أوامر الذكاء الاصطناعي YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_ui tag_anime tag_fashion tag_infographic tag_typography', 'https://x.com/GeneratePrompt/status/2053218342677147791', 'أداة توليد أوامر الذكاء الاصطناعي', 'published', NULL, 2028, 162, 86, 424, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
