  ('prompt_youm_82', 'youmind-82-comic-storyboard-gritty-comic-book-graphic-novel-portrait', 'Comic / Storyboard - Gritty Comic-Book Graphic Novel Portrait', 'Ultra-detailed cinematic comic-book portrait of a {argument name="subject" default="visionary South Asian man with messy black hair, thick beard, and rectangular glasses"}, illustrated in a gritty modern graphic novel style. Dynamic manga/comic panel composition with sharp diagonal frames, dramatic perspective shots, expressive close-ups, and ink splatter textures. The character stands confidently holding a stylus pen toward the viewer, symbolizing creativity and ambition. Background scenes show him sketching alone at a dimly lit desk, overlooking a futuristic city skyline at sunset, and surrounded by explosive golden phoenix-like energy. High-contrast chiaroscuro lighting, glowing highlights, cinematic shadows, painterly brush strokes, textured ink, detailed facial features, realistic skin tones, intense eyes with subtle blue reflections on glasses. Typography integrated into the comic panels with motivational phrases in bold hand-drawn lettering: “I DON’T FOLLOW THE PATH.” “I DRAW MY OWN.” “CREATE. FUEL. INSPIRE. REPEAT.” “I’M HERE TO LEAVE A MARK.”
