  ('prompt_youm_83', 'youmind-83-comic-storyboard-dynamic-manga-page-illustration', 'Comic / Storyboard - Dynamic Manga Page Illustration', 'Create a full-page colored manga illustration based on the person in the reference photo. Use authentic manga page composition with {argument name="panel count" default="5–7"} dynamic connected panels on a single page. Include cinematic storytelling, dramatic perspective, expressive emotions, dynamic poses, speed lines, impact frames, close-up shots, and intense visual flow.Add English comic-style sound effects, handwritten dialogue bubbles, ink splatter strokes, halftone textures, rough comic sketch lines, and graffiti-inspired brushwork. Blend vibrant colors with manga-style shading and strong contrast. Emphasize the character’s personality and aura with symbolic visual elements and atmospheric energy effects. Highly detailed, emotional, stylish, energetic, professional manga aesthetic with clean white negative space mixed with chaotic ink textures.Hand-drawn look, free-flowing lines, immersive composition, high quality. Aspect ratio 9:16 HD.', 'Transforms a reference photo into a professional multi-panel colored manga page with cinematic storytelling, expressive poses, and authentic hand-drawn textures.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Comic / Storyboard - Dynamic Manga Page Illustration Transforms a reference photo into a professional multi-panel colored manga page with cinematic storytelling, expressive poses, and authentic hand-drawn textures.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a full-page colored manga illustration based on the person in the reference photo. Use authentic manga page composition with {argument name="panel count" default="5–7"} dynamic connected panels on a single page. Include cinematic storytelling, dramatic perspective, expressive emotions, dynamic poses, speed lines, impact frames, close-up shots, and intense visual flow.Add English comic-style sound effects, handwritten dialogue bubbles, ink splatter strokes, halftone textures, rough comic sketch lines, and graffiti-inspired brushwork. Blend vibrant colors with manga-style shading and strong contrast. Emphasize the character’s personality and aura with symbolic visual elements and atmospheric energy effects. Highly detailed, emotional, stylish, energetic, professional manga aesthetic with clean white negative space mixed with chaotic ink textures.Hand-drawn look, free-flowing lines, immersive composition, high quality. Aspect ratio 9:16 HD. Anissa YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_logo tag_anime tag_scifi tag_infographic tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/SimplyAnnisa/status/2053123747604033667', 'Anissa', 'published', NULL, 1992, 158, 84, 416, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
