  ('prompt_youm_96', 'youmind-96-product-marketing-korean-aqua-cream-summer-ad', 'Product Marketing - Korean Aqua Cream Summer Ad', '{"type":"Korean skincare advertising poster","format":"single vertical social media ad, 4:5 aspect ratio","style":"premium photorealistic summer beauty commercial, bright airy blue-and-white palette, clean Korean cosmetics layout, glossy water reflections, soft sunlight, shallow depth of field","scene":{"background":"sunlit outdoor pool or seaside spa setting with sparkling blue water bokeh, pale sky, soft green tropical leaves entering from the upper-right and lower-right corners","model":"young woman with wet dark hair and bare shoulders in water, positioned on the left half, hand touching cheek, dewy skin with water droplets, face covered by a large semi-opaque square privacy placeholder in muted beige-gray gradient, placeholder centered over the face and upper neck","mood":"cool, refreshing, hydrated, calm summer morning"},"product":{"item":"transparent turquoise cosmetic jar filled with aqua gel cream","position":"lower-right foreground on a wet stone or pool ledge","label text":"{argument name=\"product label text\" default=\"LIGHT AQUA\\nWATER CREAM\\nHydrating & Refreshing\\n50 ml / 1.69 fl. oz.\"}","appearance":"open glass jar with screw-top rim, blue-tinted water cream mounded into a glossy icy peak, condensation droplets on the jar, realistic refractions and highlights"},"typography":{"language":"Korean","font style":"modern clean sans serif, large bold blue headline with lighter supporting text","main headline":"{argument name=\"headline text\" default=\"여름 아침을 깨우는\\n산뜻한 수분\"}","subheadline":"{argument name=\"subheadline text\" default=\"가볍게 스며들고, 끈적임 없이 촉촉하게\"}","product ribbon":"{argument name=\"product ribbon text\" default=\"라이트 아쿠아 수분크림\"}"},"layout":{"top-right text block":"headline at upper right, subheadline below, light blue rectangular ribbon beneath","benefit icons":{"count":3,"position":"center-right above product jar","style":"thin blue line icons inside faint circles","items":[{"icon":"water droplet","label":"투명 젤 텍스처"},{"icon":"leaf","label":"여름철 산뜻 보습"},{"icon":"snowflake","label":"쿨링감 있는 사용감"}]},"bottom information panel":{"count":2,"position":"bottom third, translucent white rounded rectangle spanning almost full width","cards":[{"title":"용도","icon":"water droplet","body":"여름철 열감으로 지친 피부에 가볍고 산뜻한 수분을 채워주는데 도움을 줍니다."},{"title":"목적","icon":"leaf","body":"무겁지 않은 보습 루틴으로 피부를 편안하고 촉촉하게 유지하도록 제안합니다."}]},"call to action":{"position":"centered at very bottom inside blue rounded pill button","icon":"small water droplet","text":"{argument name=\"button text\" default=\"올여름, 산뜻한 수분 루틴 시작하기\"}"}},"composition":"model fills left side, product jar anchors lower right, headline occupies upper right, UI panel overlays bottom, all elements aligned with generous whitespace and polished ecommerce ad hierarchy","lighting":"high-key natural daylight, cool blue highlights, glossy reflections, realistic moisture and glass caustics","quality":"ultra-realistic advertising photography with crisp product rendering, readable Korean text, no extra logos, no clutter"}', 'Generates a photorealistic Korean skincare ad for a light aqua water cream with a summer pool setting, product jar, benefits, info cards, and CTA.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Product Marketing - Korean Aqua Cream Summer Ad Generates a photorealistic Korean skincare ad for a light aqua water cream with a summer pool setting, product jar, benefits, info cards, and CTA.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 {"type":"Korean skincare advertising poster","format":"single vertical social media ad, 4:5 aspect ratio","style":"premium photorealistic summer beauty commercial, bright airy blue-and-white palette, clean Korean cosmetics layout, glossy water reflections, soft sunlight, shallow depth of field","scene":{"background":"sunlit outdoor pool or seaside spa setting with sparkling blue water bokeh, pale sky, soft green tropical leaves entering from the upper-right and lower-right corners","model":"young woman with wet dark hair and bare shoulders in water, positioned on the left half, hand touching cheek, dewy skin with water droplets, face covered by a large semi-opaque square privacy placeholder in muted beige-gray gradient, placeholder centered over the face and upper neck","mood":"cool, refreshing, hydrated, calm summer morning"},"product":{"item":"transparent turquoise cosmetic jar filled with aqua gel cream","position":"lower-right foreground on a wet stone or pool ledge","label text":"{argument name=\"product label text\" default=\"LIGHT AQUA\\nWATER CREAM\\nHydrating & Refreshing\\n50 ml / 1.69 fl. oz.\"}","appearance":"open glass jar with screw-top rim, blue-tinted water cream mounded into a glossy icy peak, condensation droplets on the jar, realistic refractions and highlights"},"typography":{"language":"Korean","font style":"modern clean sans serif, large bold blue headline with lighter supporting text","main headline":"{argument name=\"headline text\" default=\"여름 아침을 깨우는\\n산뜻한 수분\"}","subheadline":"{argument name=\"subheadline text\" default=\"가볍게 스며들고, 끈적임 없이 촉촉하게\"}","product ribbon":"{argument name=\"product ribbon text\" default=\"라이트 아쿠아 수분크림\"}"},"layout":{"top-right text block":"headline at upper right, subheadline below, light blue rectangular ribbon beneath","benefit icons":{"count":3,"position":"center-right above product jar","style":"thin blue line icons inside faint circles","items":[{"icon":"water droplet","label":"투명 젤 텍스처"},{"icon":"leaf","label":"여름철 산뜻 보습"},{"icon":"snowflake","label":"쿨링감 있는 사용감"}]},"bottom information panel":{"count":2,"position":"bottom third, translucent white rounded rectangle spanning almost full width","cards":[{"title":"용도","icon":"water droplet","body":"여름철 열감으로 지친 피부에 가볍고 산뜻한 수분을 채워주는데 도움을 줍니다."},{"title":"목적","icon":"leaf","body":"무겁지 않은 보습 루틴으로 피부를 편안하고 촉촉하게 유지하도록 제안합니다."}]},"call to action":{"position":"centered at very bottom inside blue rounded pill button","icon":"small water droplet","text":"{argument name=\"button text\" default=\"올여름, 산뜻한 수분 루틴 시작하기\"}"}},"composition":"model fills left side, product jar anchors lower right, headline occupies upper right, UI panel overlays bottom, all elements aligned with generous whitespace and polished ecommerce ad hierarchy","lighting":"high-key natural daylight, cool blue highlights, glossy reflections, realistic moisture and glass caustics","quality":"ultra-realistic advertising photography with crisp product rendering, readable Korean text, no extra logos, no clutter"} 여왕벌수호신(Queen Bee Guardian Angel) Premium+ YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_portrait tag_ui tag_logo tag_3d tag_scifi', 'https://x.com/queenbee_korea/status/2053149405130486165#reversed-0', '여왕벌수호신(Queen Bee Guardian Angel) Premium+', 'published', NULL, 1758, 132, 71, 364, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_97', 'youmind-97-product-marketing-monochrome-luxury-studio-portrait', 'Product Marketing - Monochrome Luxury Studio Portrait', 'A dramatic black-and-white studio portrait of a {argument name="subject" default="confident bearded man wearing unique, thin-framed gold round sunglasses with dark tinted lenses and a tailored dark suit"}, captured in a close-up composition with a shallow depth of field. He is positioned slightly to the right side of the frame, photographed at eye level with an 85mm portrait lens look. His head is turned to the left in profile view, gazing off-camera with a calm, contemplative expression, chin slightly raised. His left hand is loosely clenched near his chin, adding intensity and sophistication to the pose. The lighting is classic Rembrandt-style side lighting, soft yet highly directional, creating deep cinematic shadows across the right side of his face and neck while illuminating the left side of his face, forehead, nose bridge, and knuckles. Strong catchlights in the eyes are essential. The portrait should feel moody, elegant, and editorial, with rich tonal contrast and crisp texture detail. His beard is meticulously groomed with visible individual hairs and realistic skin texture including pores, eyelashes, and subtle facial lines. He has a messy hair and wears a {argument name="accessory" default="luxury metal wristwatch"} on his left wrist with reflective metallic surfaces, visible bezel details, and a polished bracelet. On the cuff of his dark jacket, a silver-toned Roman numeral “III” detail appears vertically in a bold serif style. The suit fabric is matte black with subtle folds and stitched cuff details. The watch crystal and metal edges catch highlights naturally while the clothing remains mostly matte. The overall palette is monochrome only: deep blacks, bright whites, and rich greys with very high contrast. The background is a dark studio backdrop with soft mottled texture fading into near-black shadows and a heavy vignette on the right side. Slight soft-focus blur appears in the extreme foreground near the bottom edge, adding depth and realism. Ultra-realistic photography, cinematic portrait style, luxury fashion editorial aesthetic, extremely detailed beard texture, realistic skin micro-details, sharp focus on the eyes and face, high dynamic range monochrome tones, no visible noise, no compression artifacts.', 'Creates a dramatic, high-contrast black-and-white studio portrait of a man in a suit, emphasizing textures like beard detail and reflective wristwatch surfaces.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Product Marketing - Monochrome Luxury Studio Portrait Creates a dramatic, high-contrast black-and-white studio portrait of a man in a suit, emphasizing textures like beard detail and reflective wristwatch surfaces.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 A dramatic black-and-white studio portrait of a {argument name="subject" default="confident bearded man wearing unique, thin-framed gold round sunglasses with dark tinted lenses and a tailored dark suit"}, captured in a close-up composition with a shallow depth of field. He is positioned slightly to the right side of the frame, photographed at eye level with an 85mm portrait lens look. His head is turned to the left in profile view, gazing off-camera with a calm, contemplative expression, chin slightly raised. His left hand is loosely clenched near his chin, adding intensity and sophistication to the pose. The lighting is classic Rembrandt-style side lighting, soft yet highly directional, creating deep cinematic shadows across the right side of his face and neck while illuminating the left side of his face, forehead, nose bridge, and knuckles. Strong catchlights in the eyes are essential. The portrait should feel moody, elegant, and editorial, with rich tonal contrast and crisp texture detail. His beard is meticulously groomed with visible individual hairs and realistic skin texture including pores, eyelashes, and subtle facial lines. He has a messy hair and wears a {argument name="accessory" default="luxury metal wristwatch"} on his left wrist with reflective metallic surfaces, visible bezel details, and a polished bracelet. On the cuff of his dark jacket, a silver-toned Roman numeral “III” detail appears vertically in a bold serif style. The suit fabric is matte black with subtle folds and stitched cuff details. The watch crystal and metal edges catch highlights naturally while the clothing remains mostly matte. The overall palette is monochrome only: deep blacks, bright whites, and rich greys with very high contrast. The background is a dark studio backdrop with soft mottled texture fading into near-black shadows and a heavy vignette on the right side. Slight soft-focus blur appears in the extreme foreground near the bottom edge, adding depth and realism. Ultra-realistic photography, cinematic portrait style, luxury fashion editorial aesthetic, extremely detailed beard texture, realistic skin micro-details, sharp focus on the eyes and face, high dynamic range monochrome tones, no visible noise, no compression artifacts. SPEEDYAI YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_game tag_fashion tag_architecture tag_typography', 'https://x.com/SPEEDAI07/status/2053145482504060997', 'SPEEDYAI', 'published', NULL, 1740, 130, 70, 360, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
