  ('prompt_youm_100', 'youmind-100-product-marketing-clean-authenticator-onboarding-ui-mockups', 'Product Marketing - Clean Authenticator Onboarding UI Mockups', 'Using REFERENCE_0 and REFERENCE_1 as the design references, recreate the same 4 mobile onboarding screens as clean, high-fidelity UI mockups instead of a photographed laptop screen. Remove all perspective distortion, laptop/browser surroundings, glare, and camera artifacts. Present the four iPhone-style screens front-facing, evenly spaced in one horizontal row on a light gray canvas, preserving the dark-mode version from REFERENCE_0 and the same screen order, typography hierarchy, blue security visual style, rounded phone frames, status bars, skip links, bottom home indicators, and CTA structure. Keep exactly 4 screens: 1) authenticator account protection with “Get Started”, 2) timely alerts with notification toggle and “Continue”, 3) end-to-end encryption with shield/lock and social icons plus “Continue”, 4) Face ID protection quick setup with scan overlay, toggle, and “Continue”. Make the UI crisp, polished, app-store-presentation ready, with sharp readable text and consistent spacing.', 'Generates a polished four-screen dark-mode mobile onboarding presentation from photographed UI references, useful for app landing pages or design showcases.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Product Marketing - Clean Authenticator Onboarding UI Mockups Generates a polished four-screen dark-mode mobile onboarding presentation from photographed UI references, useful for app landing pages or design showcases.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Using REFERENCE_0 and REFERENCE_1 as the design references, recreate the same 4 mobile onboarding screens as clean, high-fidelity UI mockups instead of a photographed laptop screen. Remove all perspective distortion, laptop/browser surroundings, glare, and camera artifacts. Present the four iPhone-style screens front-facing, evenly spaced in one horizontal row on a light gray canvas, preserving the dark-mode version from REFERENCE_0 and the same screen order, typography hierarchy, blue security visual style, rounded phone frames, status bars, skip links, bottom home indicators, and CTA structure. Keep exactly 4 screens: 1) authenticator account protection with “Get Started”, 2) timely alerts with notification toggle and “Continue”, 3) end-to-end encryption with shield/lock and social icons plus “Continue”, 4) Face ID protection quick setup with scan overlay, toggle, and “Continue”. Make the UI crisp, polished, app-store-presentation ready, with sharp readable text and consistent spacing. Soumyadip YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_ui tag_mockup tag_logo tag_scifi tag_typography tag_gufeng', 'https://x.com/soumyadipdzign/status/2053118860350652756#reversed-1', 'Soumyadip', 'published', NULL, 1686, 124, 67, 348, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
