  ('prompt_youm_101', 'youmind-101-product-marketing-minimalist-men-s-fashion-collage', 'Product Marketing - Minimalist Men''s Fashion Collage', 'Create a clean minimalist fashion collage featuring **{argument name="outfit count" default="8"} different {argument name="clothing style" default="casual everyday outfits"} for a {argument name="subject" default="young man"}** arranged across a soft beige studio background, inspired by a lifestyle lookbook aesthetic.
