  ('prompt_youm_102', 'youmind-102-product-marketing-popmart-style-3d-character-toy', 'Product Marketing - Popmart Style 3D Character Toy', 'A premium collectible toy figure product poster on a bold solid bright {argument name="background color" default="orange"} background, a chubby adorable 3D character with an oversized round head, tiny misaligned cartoon eyes, a flat wide mouth showing a single buck tooth, wearing a tiny {argument name="hat type" default="purple knit beanie hat"} slightly tilted and a small yellow fanny pack across its body, a band-aid sticker on one cheek, the figure rendered in soft matte clay texture with subtle ambient occlusion shadows, photographed from a slightly low angle, large bold condensed black typography at the top left reading "{argument name="title text" default="JUST BE YOU"}" in massive letters, small italic descriptor text below reading "Not fast. Not smart. Just yourself.", white bottom strip showing front side back and 45-degree angle views of the character, clean premium Popmart blind box collectible aesthetic, 9:16 vertical ratio', 'A professional toy figure poster prompt in Popmart style, featuring a 3D character with matte clay textures and bold typography.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Product Marketing - Popmart Style 3D Character Toy A professional toy figure poster prompt in Popmart style, featuring a 3D character with matte clay textures and bold typography.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 A premium collectible toy figure product poster on a bold solid bright {argument name="background color" default="orange"} background, a chubby adorable 3D character with an oversized round head, tiny misaligned cartoon eyes, a flat wide mouth showing a single buck tooth, wearing a tiny {argument name="hat type" default="purple knit beanie hat"} slightly tilted and a small yellow fanny pack across its body, a band-aid sticker on one cheek, the figure rendered in soft matte clay texture with subtle ambient occlusion shadows, photographed from a slightly low angle, large bold condensed black typography at the top left reading "{argument name="title text" default="JUST BE YOU"}" in massive letters, small italic descriptor text below reading "Not fast. Not smart. Just yourself.", white bottom strip showing front side back and 45-degree angle views of the character, clean premium Popmart blind box collectible aesthetic, 9:16 vertical ratio Easy A.I. YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_3d tag_sticker tag_typography tag_illustration', 'https://x.com/92digitalartArt/status/2053098840752795730', 'Easy A.I.', 'published', NULL, 1650, 120, 65, 340, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
