  ('prompt_youm_103', 'youmind-103-product-marketing-fashion-magazine-cover-editorial', 'Product Marketing - Fashion Magazine Cover Editorial', 'Ultra realistic fashion editorial magazine cover featuring [REFERENCE PERSON] sitting confidently on a low wooden pallet bench in a modern creative studio environment. Subject wears an all black minimalist outfit consisting of a black denim jacket, oversized black pants, black t shirt, and black Converse style sneakers with white laces and rubber soles. Relaxed wide leg sitting posture, leaning slightly forward with one elbow resting on the knee and one finger touching the side of the temple, making direct eye contact with the camera. Expression is calm, intelligent, creative, and self assured.
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_104', 'youmind-104-product-marketing-two-kimono-acrylic-standee-characters', 'Product Marketing - Two Kimono Acrylic Standee Characters', '{"type":"product mockup illustration of two anime-style acrylic standees","scene":"A clean studio product photo composition on a warm off-white background, showing 2 transparent acrylic character stands side by side with glossy cutout edges and clear support tabs inserted into decorative bases. Soft diffuse lighting, subtle shadows, elegant muted colors, highly detailed fabric rendering, refined Japanese historical fantasy atmosphere.","counted_elements":{"acrylic standees":2,"characters":2,"decorative bases":2,"handheld props":2},"characters":[{"label":"left standee","character_name":"{argument name=\"left character name\" default=\"Riichiro\"}","position":"left, taller, slightly larger scale, standing upright facing forward with a stern quiet presence","appearance":"long wavy black hair tied loosely back with stray strands, pale skin, face intentionally softly obscured, slim tall build","outfit":"layered black and deep navy Japanese kimono and haori ensemble, dark pleated hakama, wide sleeves, subtle floral and grass embroidery near the hem, small crest detail on the chest, decorative chain draped across the upper body, black leather lace-up boots","handheld_prop":"one dark rectangular book or notebook with gold floral ornament and a small red tassel, held in the left hand","base":"dark navy and black flower-shaped acrylic base with gold linework, pale blossoms, branch motifs, and geometric stripe accents, matching the character''s serious dark mood"},{"label":"right standee","character_name":"{argument name=\"right character name\" default=\"Iki\"}","position":"right, slightly shorter, standing relaxed and facing forward with a gentler pale-toned presence","appearance":"soft tousled light blond hair, pale skin, face intentionally softly obscured, slender build","outfit":"pale cream translucent haori over a light blue-gray kimono, beige-gray pleated hakama, delicate botanical embroidery on the sleeves and hem, long cord necklace with a small pendant, tasseled obi ornament, light lace-up boots","handheld_prop":"one slender branch of small white blossoms held upright in the right hand","base":"clear pale beige flower-shaped acrylic base with white blossoms, brown branch motifs, soft gold and blue geometric accents, matching the bright gentle mood"}],"style":"delicate semi-realistic anime illustration, elegant merch concept art, acrylic stand product photography, translucent clear plastic borders visible around each character silhouette, refined linework, soft watercolor-like shading, intricate textile patterns, no visible text, no labels, no packaging","composition":"Both standees are full-body, feet inserted into transparent slots, left standee occupies more vertical height and visual weight, right standee is placed slightly behind and to the right with more negative space above. The contrast is black and dark formal clothing versus pale cream and light pastel clothing, measuring-side versus photographing-side atmosphere.","customization_notes":"Keep the faces softly blurred or featureless if privacy-like anonymity is desired; preserve the contrast between one dark serious standee and one light cheerful standee.","quality":"high resolution, crisp acrylic edges, realistic glossy reflections, elegant collectible merchandise render"}', 'Generates a refined product mockup of two anime-style Japanese fantasy acrylic standees with contrasting dark and pale kimono designs.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Product Marketing - Two Kimono Acrylic Standee Characters Generates a refined product mockup of two anime-style Japanese fantasy acrylic standees with contrasting dark and pale kimono designs.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 {"type":"product mockup illustration of two anime-style acrylic standees","scene":"A clean studio product photo composition on a warm off-white background, showing 2 transparent acrylic character stands side by side with glossy cutout edges and clear support tabs inserted into decorative bases. Soft diffuse lighting, subtle shadows, elegant muted colors, highly detailed fabric rendering, refined Japanese historical fantasy atmosphere.","counted_elements":{"acrylic standees":2,"characters":2,"decorative bases":2,"handheld props":2},"characters":[{"label":"left standee","character_name":"{argument name=\"left character name\" default=\"Riichiro\"}","position":"left, taller, slightly larger scale, standing upright facing forward with a stern quiet presence","appearance":"long wavy black hair tied loosely back with stray strands, pale skin, face intentionally softly obscured, slim tall build","outfit":"layered black and deep navy Japanese kimono and haori ensemble, dark pleated hakama, wide sleeves, subtle floral and grass embroidery near the hem, small crest detail on the chest, decorative chain draped across the upper body, black leather lace-up boots","handheld_prop":"one dark rectangular book or notebook with gold floral ornament and a small red tassel, held in the left hand","base":"dark navy and black flower-shaped acrylic base with gold linework, pale blossoms, branch motifs, and geometric stripe accents, matching the character''s serious dark mood"},{"label":"right standee","character_name":"{argument name=\"right character name\" default=\"Iki\"}","position":"right, slightly shorter, standing relaxed and facing forward with a gentler pale-toned presence","appearance":"soft tousled light blond hair, pale skin, face intentionally softly obscured, slender build","outfit":"pale cream translucent haori over a light blue-gray kimono, beige-gray pleated hakama, delicate botanical embroidery on the sleeves and hem, long cord necklace with a small pendant, tasseled obi ornament, light lace-up boots","handheld_prop":"one slender branch of small white blossoms held upright in the right hand","base":"clear pale beige flower-shaped acrylic base with white blossoms, brown branch motifs, soft gold and blue geometric accents, matching the bright gentle mood"}],"style":"delicate semi-realistic anime illustration, elegant merch concept art, acrylic stand product photography, translucent clear plastic borders visible around each character silhouette, refined linework, soft watercolor-like shading, intricate textile patterns, no visible text, no labels, no packaging","composition":"Both standees are full-body, feet inserted into transparent slots, left standee occupies more vertical height and visual weight, right standee is placed slightly behind and to the right with more negative space above. The contrast is black and dark formal clothing versus pale cream and light pastel clothing, measuring-side versus photographing-side atmosphere.","customization_notes":"Keep the faces softly blurred or featureless if privacy-like anonymity is desired; preserve the contrast between one dark serious standee and one light cheerful standee.","quality":"high resolution, crisp acrylic edges, realistic glossy reflections, elegant collectible merchandise render"} Tsumugi Iori(つむぎ) YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_mockup tag_3d tag_anime tag_scifi', 'https://x.com/tsumugiuta_000/status/2053092949530137051#reversed-0', 'Tsumugi Iori(つむぎ)', 'published', NULL, 1614, 116, 63, 332, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_105', 'youmind-105-product-marketing-pop-art-streetwear-fashion-photography', 'Product Marketing - Pop Art Streetwear Fashion Photography', 'A full-body fashion editorial scene against a vibrant {argument name="background color" default="electric-blue"} studio background with layered geometric blue shapes and overlays. The composition has a youthful, energetic pop-art aesthetic blending realistic streetwear photography with playful 2D graphic doodles. The character is standing in a confident wide-leg pose, one hand casually touching their hair/head, facing the camera. Outfit includes a glossy {argument name="jacket type" default="navy blue puffer jacket"} as the centerpiece, layered over a minimal dark t-shirt, black cargo pants, a small black crossbody utility bag, and white sneakers with blue accents. Hand-drawn white doodles are scattered around the scene, including cartoon-style motion swirls, lightning bolts, exclamation marks, plus signs, and a cute {argument name="animal" default="cartoon dog"} in the bottom-left corner. Clean studio lighting, high contrast, trendy urban fashion campaign style, dynamic composition, crisp shadows, modern streetwear aesthetic, playful graphic design fusion, highly detailed, professional fashion photography.', 'A dynamic prompt for creating a pop-art inspired fashion editorial featuring realistic streetwear photography blended with playful 2D graphic doodles.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Product Marketing - Pop Art Streetwear Fashion Photography A dynamic prompt for creating a pop-art inspired fashion editorial featuring realistic streetwear photography blended with playful 2D graphic doodles.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 A full-body fashion editorial scene against a vibrant {argument name="background color" default="electric-blue"} studio background with layered geometric blue shapes and overlays. The composition has a youthful, energetic pop-art aesthetic blending realistic streetwear photography with playful 2D graphic doodles. The character is standing in a confident wide-leg pose, one hand casually touching their hair/head, facing the camera. Outfit includes a glossy {argument name="jacket type" default="navy blue puffer jacket"} as the centerpiece, layered over a minimal dark t-shirt, black cargo pants, a small black crossbody utility bag, and white sneakers with blue accents. Hand-drawn white doodles are scattered around the scene, including cartoon-style motion swirls, lightning bolts, exclamation marks, plus signs, and a cute {argument name="animal" default="cartoon dog"} in the bottom-left corner. Clean studio lighting, high contrast, trendy urban fashion campaign style, dynamic composition, crisp shadows, modern streetwear aesthetic, playful graphic design fusion, highly detailed, professional fashion photography. NoorAI YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_fashion', 'https://x.com/noorwithwifi/status/2053092860510240980', 'NoorAI', 'published', NULL, 1596, 114, 62, 328, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_106', 'youmind-106-product-marketing-alpine-landscape-souvenir-magnet', 'Product Marketing - Alpine Landscape Souvenir Magnet', 'Create a vertically stacked comparison image with exactly 2 horizontal sections: the top section is a minimalist studio product shot of 1 small enamel refrigerator magnet, centered on a pale textured blue background with lots of negative space; the magnet is shaped like a miniature mountain landscape souvenir, with a shiny gold-metal outline, raised enamel details, snow-capped blue-gray peaks, green rolling hills, dark evergreen trees, and a foreground band of tiny yellow, purple, and blue wildflowers, casting a soft realistic shadow. The bottom section is a bright realistic landscape photo of {argument name="location" default="an alpine grassland valley"} under a blue sky with fluffy white clouds: wide green rolling hills, distant snow-streaked mountains, dark pine forests, and a colorful wildflower meadow in the foreground with yellow, purple, and blue blooms. Include exactly 4 horseback riders crossing the meadow near the lower center, small in scale against the vast scenery. Make the magnet in the top section feel like a distilled souvenir version of the landscape below, preserving the same key visual elements: mountains, green hills, conifer trees, wildflowers, and open sky. Use clean editorial composition, realistic lighting, crisp detail, soft shadows, and a calm travel-memory aesthetic. No visible text, no labels, no watermark.', 'Generates a two-part image showing a realistic alpine scene transformed into a small enamel refrigerator magnet souvenir.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Product Marketing - Alpine Landscape Souvenir Magnet Generates a two-part image showing a realistic alpine scene transformed into a small enamel refrigerator magnet souvenir.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a vertically stacked comparison image with exactly 2 horizontal sections: the top section is a minimalist studio product shot of 1 small enamel refrigerator magnet, centered on a pale textured blue background with lots of negative space; the magnet is shaped like a miniature mountain landscape souvenir, with a shiny gold-metal outline, raised enamel details, snow-capped blue-gray peaks, green rolling hills, dark evergreen trees, and a foreground band of tiny yellow, purple, and blue wildflowers, casting a soft realistic shadow. The bottom section is a bright realistic landscape photo of {argument name="location" default="an alpine grassland valley"} under a blue sky with fluffy white clouds: wide green rolling hills, distant snow-streaked mountains, dark pine forests, and a colorful wildflower meadow in the foreground with yellow, purple, and blue blooms. Include exactly 4 horseback riders crossing the meadow near the lower center, small in scale against the vast scenery. Make the magnet in the top section feel like a distilled souvenir version of the landscape below, preserving the same key visual elements: mountains, green hills, conifer trees, wildflowers, and open sky. Use clean editorial composition, realistic lighting, crisp detail, soft shadows, and a calm travel-memory aesthetic. No visible text, no labels, no watermark. 两斤 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_poster tag_ui tag_3d tag_scifi tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/0x00_Krypt/status/2053066149630492796#reversed-0', '两斤', 'published', NULL, 1578, 112, 61, 324, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
INSERT INTO `prompts` (`id`, `slug`, `title`, `content`, `description`, `search_text`, `source_url`, `source_author`, `status`, `author_id`, `view_count`, `like_count`, `collect_count`, `copy_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`)
VALUES
  ('prompt_youm_107', 'youmind-107-product-marketing-reze-prize-figure-product-shot', 'Product Marketing - Reze Prize Figure Product Shot', 'Create a high-end studio product photograph of a glossy anime prize figure of {argument name="character name" default="Reze"}, shown as a seated young woman figurine kneeling on a round tufted cushion base. The figure has {argument name="hair color" default="dark purple-black"} short bobbed hair with layered bangs and a small low side bun, pale skin, and a deliberately soft blurred face with no readable facial details. She wears a sleeveless pale lavender-white button-up blouse with a small black ribbon tie at the collar, fitted high-waisted black shorts, and smooth black thigh-high stockings; the blouse has faint semi-transparent lettering across the chest reading {argument name="shirt text" default="NOMAI"}. Pose her with both knees folded forward on the cushion, one hand resting on each side for support, torso slightly leaning back, shoulders relaxed, creating the look of a collectible scale figure rather than a real person. The base is a single circular display plinth: a black outer rim with a tan caramel-brown quilted leather-like cushion on top, including deep button-tufted depressions and glossy highlights. Use clean white seamless background, soft diffused studio lighting, sharp focus on the figure and base, realistic PVC figure material, subtle skin and fabric sheen, premium prize-figure product photography, three-quarter front view from slightly above, centered composition, no packaging, no extra props, no watermark except the faint shirt text.', 'Generates a clean studio product image of an anime-style kneeling prize figure on a tufted circular display base.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'Product Marketing - Reze Prize Figure Product Shot Generates a clean studio product image of an anime-style kneeling prize figure on a tufted circular display base.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a high-end studio product photograph of a glossy anime prize figure of {argument name="character name" default="Reze"}, shown as a seated young woman figurine kneeling on a round tufted cushion base. The figure has {argument name="hair color" default="dark purple-black"} short bobbed hair with layered bangs and a small low side bun, pale skin, and a deliberately soft blurred face with no readable facial details. She wears a sleeveless pale lavender-white button-up blouse with a small black ribbon tie at the collar, fitted high-waisted black shorts, and smooth black thigh-high stockings; the blouse has faint semi-transparent lettering across the chest reading {argument name="shirt text" default="NOMAI"}. Pose her with both knees folded forward on the cushion, one hand resting on each side for support, torso slightly leaning back, shoulders relaxed, creating the look of a collectible scale figure rather than a real person. The base is a single circular display plinth: a black outer rim with a tan caramel-brown quilted leather-like cushion on top, including deep button-tufted depressions and glossy highlights. Use clean white seamless background, soft diffused studio lighting, sharp focus on the figure and base, realistic PVC figure material, subtle skin and fabric sheen, premium prize-figure product photography, three-quarter front view from slightly above, centered composition, no packaging, no extra props, no watermark except the faint shirt text. NOMA @Aiイラスト YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_anime tag_typography tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/Xai0180/status/2053056430870340047#reversed-0', 'NOMA @Aiイラスト', 'published', NULL, 1560, 110, 60, 320, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
