  ('prompt_youm_108', 'youmind-108-product-marketing-realistic-citizenship-identity-card', 'Product Marketing - Realistic Citizenship Identity Card', 'Ultra-realistic 16:9 close-up studio photograph of a {argument name="country" default="Russian Federation"} citizenship identity card placed on a clean light grey or white background. The card is horizontally aligned, centered in frame, captured in sharp macro focus with soft diffused studio lighting.
