  ('prompt_youm_119', 'youmind-119-e-commerce-main-image-cheshire-cat-plush-toy', 'E-commerce Main Image - Cheshire Cat Plush Toy', 'Create a high-end studio product photo of a plush toy inspired by the {argument name="character" default="Cheshire Cat"}, centered against a deep black background and seated on a matte black rectangular pedestal. The plush is made of soft velvety fabric in rich {argument name="main color" default="dark purple"} with deep teal-blue striped accents on the ears, forehead, arms, legs, and curled tail. It has a large rounded cat head, tall pointed ears with teal inner panels, oversized glossy black button-like eyes with bright catchlights, a tiny black nose, and an exaggerated wide crescent grin filled with warm cream-yellow rectangular teeth. The body is squat and cuddly with long floppy arms and legs, small paw pads on the feet, subtle stitched seams, and a teal ornamental flame-like emblem embroidered on the belly. The striped tail curls outward behind both sides of the pedestal. Use dramatic softbox lighting from the front-left, gentle rim highlights, realistic plush fibers, visible stitching, tactile fabric texture, shallow depth of field, symmetrical composition, dark whimsical fantasy mood, ultra-detailed commercial toy photography, square image.', 'Generates a dark whimsical studio product photo of a purple striped Cheshire Cat plush, useful for toy concept art or collectible design visualization.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'E-commerce Main Image - Cheshire Cat Plush Toy Generates a dark whimsical studio product photo of a purple striped Cheshire Cat plush, useful for toy concept art or collectible design visualization.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Create a high-end studio product photo of a plush toy inspired by the {argument name="character" default="Cheshire Cat"}, centered against a deep black background and seated on a matte black rectangular pedestal. The plush is made of soft velvety fabric in rich {argument name="main color" default="dark purple"} with deep teal-blue striped accents on the ears, forehead, arms, legs, and curled tail. It has a large rounded cat head, tall pointed ears with teal inner panels, oversized glossy black button-like eyes with bright catchlights, a tiny black nose, and an exaggerated wide crescent grin filled with warm cream-yellow rectangular teeth. The body is squat and cuddly with long floppy arms and legs, small paw pads on the feet, subtle stitched seams, and a teal ornamental flame-like emblem embroidered on the belly. The striped tail curls outward behind both sides of the pedestal. Use dramatic softbox lighting from the front-left, gentle rim highlights, realistic plush fibers, visible stitching, tactile fabric texture, shallow depth of field, symmetrical composition, dark whimsical fantasy mood, ultra-detailed commercial toy photography, square image. Tom Löwe YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_infographic tag_typography', 'https://x.com/Excelsior_AI/status/2051977864933720094#reversed-1', 'Tom Löwe', 'published', NULL, 1344, 86, 48, 272, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
