  ('prompt_youm_121', 'youmind-121-e-commerce-main-image-psychedelic-commercial-beverage-photography', 'E-commerce Main Image - Psychedelic Commercial Beverage Photography', 'Ultra-detailed commercial product photography of a slim aluminum soda can labeled "{argument name="brand name" default="Chilsung Cider"}" placed center frame, vibrant psychedelic liquid swirls exploding from behind and wrapping around the can, flowing paint ribbons in pink, cyan, yellow, white, and green, {argument name="flavor elements" default="fresh lime and sparkling water textures"} integrated into the can artwork, playful hand-painted illustration style mixed with glossy advertising realism, {argument name="background color" default="bright pastel yellow"} studio background with soft green geometric shape, high saturation, crisp outlines, ink splash details, whimsical pop-art aesthetic, Korean beverage ad style, dynamic motion composition, glossy reflections, ultra clean lighting, modern editorial poster design, highly detailed, 8k, premium beverage branding, colorful abstract fluid art, refreshing summer vibe.', 'A vibrant, high-end product photography prompt for beverages, combining liquid explosions, paint ribbons, and modern editorial styling.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'E-commerce Main Image - Psychedelic Commercial Beverage Photography A vibrant, high-end product photography prompt for beverages, combining liquid explosions, paint ribbons, and modern editorial styling.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Ultra-detailed commercial product photography of a slim aluminum soda can labeled "{argument name="brand name" default="Chilsung Cider"}" placed center frame, vibrant psychedelic liquid swirls exploding from behind and wrapping around the can, flowing paint ribbons in pink, cyan, yellow, white, and green, {argument name="flavor elements" default="fresh lime and sparkling water textures"} integrated into the can artwork, playful hand-painted illustration style mixed with glossy advertising realism, {argument name="background color" default="bright pastel yellow"} studio background with soft green geometric shape, high saturation, crisp outlines, ink splash details, whimsical pop-art aesthetic, Korean beverage ad style, dynamic motion composition, glossy reflections, ultra clean lighting, modern editorial poster design, highly detailed, 8k, premium beverage branding, colorful abstract fluid art, refreshing summer vibe. Kashberg YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_food tag_poster tag_portrait tag_ui tag_typography tag_illustration', 'https://x.com/Kashberg_0/status/2051863969418354785', 'Kashberg', 'published', NULL, 1308, 82, 46, 264, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
