 blue jacket, green loose pants, white sneakers","mood":"fresh clean skincare campaign"},{"position":"middle right","shape":"rounded rectangle","product":"red Anua niacinamide serum dropper bottle held close to lens","model":"woman in teal flowing blouse and coral skirt leaning dynamically behind product","mood":"glowing serum beauty ad"},{"position":"bottom right","shape":"rounded rectangle","product":"white Nike Air Force 1 sneaker with black swoosh held forward","model":"woman wearing cream cropped jacket, white crop top, black-and-cream pleated skirt","mood":"sport-luxury fashion product shot"}]},"product_customization":{"primary product brand":"{argument name=\"primary product brand\" default=\"CeraVe\"}","fashion palette":"{argument name=\"fashion color palette\" default=\"red, coral, teal, green, white, black\"}","model style":"{argument name=\"model style\" default=\"diverse high-fashion female models with blurred faces\"}"},"visual_style":"hyper-realistic commercial product photography, studio flash, clean white seamless background, sharp products, slightly motion-filled model poses, wide-angle close-up hands, editorial magazine collage, rounded cards, subtle shadows, accurate readable packaging typography, premium social media template aesthetic","quality":"ultra detailed, photorealistic, high resolution, polished advertising composition"} Mr|Mamba YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_ui tag_3d tag_scifi tag_fashion tag_infographic', 'https://x.com/MrMamba_NFT/status/2051322333692899623#reversed-0', 'Mr|Mamba', 'published', NULL, 1272, 78, 44, 256, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
