  ('prompt_youm_124', 'youmind-124-e-commerce-main-image-minimalist-perfume-commercial', 'E-commerce Main Image - Minimalist Perfume Commercial', 'Minimalist commercial ad featuring {argument name="product" default="oversized white perfume bottle"}, ultra-clean design. A young woman in all-white outfit leans casually against the giant bottle, relaxed confident pose, eyes closed, holding the same perfume bottle in her hand. Soft gradient blue background with large bold white “{argument name="brand" default="CHANEL"}” text behind. Glossy reflective floor, soft studio lighting, modern high-end fashion/product photography. Small top-right text “Designed by Mr Das”. Bottom center tagline in small white font: “{argument name="tagline" default="Elegance in every drop"}.”', 'A clean and minimalist commercial advertisement prompt for luxury perfume branding with professional studio lighting.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'E-commerce Main Image - Minimalist Perfume Commercial A clean and minimalist commercial advertisement prompt for luxury perfume branding with professional studio lighting.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 Minimalist commercial ad featuring {argument name="product" default="oversized white perfume bottle"}, ultra-clean design. A young woman in all-white outfit leans casually against the giant bottle, relaxed confident pose, eyes closed, holding the same perfume bottle in her hand. Soft gradient blue background with large bold white “{argument name="brand" default="CHANEL"}” text behind. Glossy reflective floor, soft studio lighting, modern high-end fashion/product photography. Small top-right text “Designed by Mr Das”. Bottom center tagline in small white font: “{argument name="tagline" default="Elegance in every drop"}.” Mr Das YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_fashion tag_typography', 'https://x.com/MrDasOnX/status/2051320489830965611', 'Mr Das', 'published', NULL, 1254, 76, 43, 252, cast(unixepoch('