  ('prompt_youm_125', 'youmind-125-e-commerce-main-image-underwater-smartphone-product-shoot', 'E-commerce Main Image - Underwater Smartphone Product Shoot', 'A premium underwater commercial photoshoot featuring a sleek {argument name="product" default="Galaxy S Series smartphone"} as the hero product, held in the foreground in a selfie position and captured in sharp focus, with realistic water droplets and reflections enhancing its metallic finish and camera lenses. In the mid-ground, a {argument name="person" default="woman"} floats naturally in clear tropical blue water with a relaxed, cheerful expression, her hair gently flowing with the movement, while the focus remains primarily on the product. In the background, a playful {argument name="background animal" default="dolphin"} swims slightly out of focus, adding a sense of motion and liveliness. Sunlight streams from above, creating soft underwater rays and natural caustic patterns, with small air bubbles rising organically and a clean blue gradient environment keeping distractions minimal for a premium advertisement look. The style is ultra-photorealistic commercial product photography in 8K with HDR lighting, using a wide-angle perspective and shallow depth of field, capturing a mood that feels fresh, clean, premium, and adventurous, with the product in crisp foreground focus and supporting elements softly blurred.', 'A high-end underwater commercial photography prompt featuring a smartphone with realistic water caustic patterns and atmospheric lighting.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。', 'E-commerce Main Image - Underwater Smartphone Product Shoot A high-end underwater commercial photography prompt featuring a smartphone with realistic water caustic patterns and atmospheric lighting.。来自 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image-2 案例库。 A premium underwater commercial photoshoot featuring a sleek {argument name="product" default="Galaxy S Series smartphone"} as the hero product, held in the foreground in a selfie position and captured in sharp focus, with realistic water droplets and reflections enhancing its metallic finish and camera lenses. In the mid-ground, a {argument name="person" default="woman"} floats naturally in clear tropical blue water with a relaxed, cheerful expression, her hair gently flowing with the movement, while the focus remains primarily on the product. In the background, a playful {argument name="background animal" default="dolphin"} swims slightly out of focus, adding a sense of motion and liveliness. Sunlight streams from above, creating soft underwater rays and natural caustic patterns, with small air bubbles rising organically and a clean blue gradient environment keeping distractions minimal for a premium advertisement look. The style is ultra-photorealistic commercial product photography in 8K with HDR lighting, using a wide-angle perspective and shallow depth of field, capturing a mood that feels fresh, clean, premium, and adventurous, with the product in crisp foreground focus and supporting elements softly blurred. 𝐌 YouMind-OpenLab GPT-Image 2 NanoBanan tag_ai_image tag_youmind tag_portrait tag_mockup tag_cinematic', 'https://x.com/Strength04_X/status/2051299783986512251', '𝐌', 'published', NULL, 1236, 74, 42, 248, cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer), cast(unixepoch('subsecond') * 1000 as integer));
